<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ayuba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ayuba xa Taruxui</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayuba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ayu</para>
  <para style="mt">Ayuba xa Taruxui</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi kitaabui findixi Ayuba xa taruxui nan na naxan masenyi hagigɛ masenma adamadie birin bɛ. Kabi won benba Adama nun nɛnɛ Mahawa to yunubi raba, mixi birin na duniɲa igirife na tɔɔrɛ nan kui. Na tɔɔrɛ nɔma a niyade mixie xa xɔnɔ Ala ma, e fa a maxɔrin munfe ra a e luma e xa tɔɔrɔ. Xa mixie ɲɔxɔ a ma a e bara e ɲɛrɛ tinxinyi kui Ala ya i, na yaabi fife xɔrɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ayuba xa fe nu na na ki nɛ. A booree naxa a fala a bɛ a tɔɔrɛ ɲaaxi a sɔtɔ a xa yunubie nan ma fe ra. Ayuba mu tin na yaabi ra, a fa a fala na mu a ra. Na kui a nu wama Ala xa kiiti xɔn alako a xa a kolon a ɲaxankataxi fe naxan ma. A raɲɔnyi Ala naxa a masen Ayuba bɛ a a mu nɔma Alatala xa fe raba ki fahaamude. Ayuba to so na fe kui a bɔɲɛ birin na, a xaxili naxa sa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɔnɔ bafe na masenyi ra, sɛriyɛ gbɛtɛ toma yi taruxui kui naxan tide gbo. Ala to barakɛ sa Ayuba xa fe ma a xa tinxinyi xa fe ra, Sentanɛ naxa Ayuba tɔɔɲɛgɛ a falafe ra Ala bɛ a Ayuba nu birama Ala waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra alako a xa barakɛ sɔtɔ tun. Ala nu wama a masenfe Sentanɛ bɛ a a xa tinxintɔɛ Ayuba nu na Ala xa sɛriyɛ ratinmɛfe fe gbɛtɛ nan ma. Ala naxa tin tɔɔrɛ xa dɔxɔ Ayuba ma, alako Sentanɛ xa a to na tɔɔrɛ mu nu nɔma a niyade Ayuba xa Ala xa sɛriyɛ bɛɲin.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kui won birin nɔma a kolonde a mu lanma won xa bira Alatala fɔxɔ ra alako won xa barakɛ tun sɔtɔ. A lanma won xa Ala xui suxu barima won Daa Marigi nan na Alatala ra. Xa won barakɛ sɔtɔ, xa won mu a sɔtɔ, a lanma won xa won Marigi Alatala batu won ma fe birin kui. Ala xa won mali na rabade. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ayuba xa Taruxui</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Alatala nun Sentanɛ xa dɛ masarɛ singe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Xɛmɛ nde nu na Usu bɔxi ma naxan nu xili Ayuba. Mixi hagigɛ nan nu lanxi a ma, a matinxin. A nu gaaxuma Ala ya ra, a mu nu birama fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Di xɛmɛ solofere nun di ginɛ saxan nu na a yi ra. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />A xa gɔɔrɛ nu lanxi yɛxɛɛ wulu solofere, ɲɔxɔmɛ wulu saxan, ninge wulu keren, a nun sofale kɛmɛ suuli nan ma. Walikɛ gbegbe saxi na nan fari. Binyɛ nu saxi yi xɛmɛ ma dangi mixi birin na na sogetede biri ra.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />A xa die nu xulunyi tima nɛ e boore xɔnyie, e nu e maaginɛe xili alako e birin xa nu e dɛge yire keren. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Xulunyie na ba a ra, Ayuba nu sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie bama nɛ a xa di birin bɛ e rasɛniyɛnfe ra. A nu a maɲɔxunma nɛ a tɛmunde e bara yunubi nde sɔtɔ, xa na mu a ra e bara Ala danka e bɔɲɛ kui. Na kui Ayuba nu luma sɛrɛxɛ ba ra e bɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Lɔxɔɛ nde Ala xa malekɛe naxa fa Alatala yire. Sentanɛ fan nu na e ya ma. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Alatala naxa Sentanɛ maxɔrin, «I kelixi minden?» Sentanɛ naxa a yaabi, «N kelixi duniɲa iɲɛrɛde.» <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Alatala man naxa a maxɔrin, «I bara n ma konyi Ayuba rakɔrɔsi? A maniyɛ yo mu na duniɲa ma. A fan, a tinxin. Ala yaragaaxui nan a ra, fe ɲaaxi mu rafan a ma.» <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Sentanɛ naxa a yaabi, «Ayuba xa gaaxui i ya ra tun mu a ra? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />I mu a kantaxi xɛ, a tan, a xa denbaya, nun a harige birin? I bara barakɛ sa a suxufe birin ma, alako a xa gɔɔrɛ xa gbo tun. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Kɔnɔ xa a sa li i naxa din a harige ra, n xa a fala i bɛ, a fama nɛ i dankade keren na.» <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Alatala naxa a fala Sentanɛ bɛ, «Awa yire, n bara a harige birin sa i sagoe, kɔnɔ i naxa a gundi tɔɔrɔ de.» Na tɛmui Sentanɛ naxa keli Alatala yire.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Lɔxɔɛ nde Ayuba xa die nu na xulunyi tife e taara xɔnyi. <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />Xɛɛra nde naxa fa Ayuba yire, a a fala a bɛ, «I xa walikɛe nu na ningee rawalife xɛ ma, sofalee fan nu na e dɛ madonfe na longori. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Sebaka ndee naxa din i xa walikɛe ra, e e faxa santidɛgɛma ra. E man ningee fan xanin. N keren peti nan nɔ n yɛtɛ bade e yi. N faxi na fe nan dɛntɛgɛde i bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Na mu gɛ na masenyi ra, xɛɛra gbɛtɛ naxa fa, a a fala Ayuba bɛ, «Ala bara a ragiri galanyi xa goro i xa yɛxɛɛe nun e makantamae ma. A bara e birin faxa. N keren peti nan nɔ n yɛtɛ bade e yi. N faxi na fe nan dɛntɛgɛde i bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Na fan mu gɛ a xa masenyi ra, xɛɛra gbɛtɛ naxa fa, a a fala Ayuba bɛ, «Kalidika, gaali dɔxɔ saxan bara bagan i xa ɲɔxɔmɛe ma, e e makantamae faxa santidɛgɛma ra, e ɲɔxɔmɛe xanin. N keren peti nan nɔ n bade e yi. N faxi na fe nan dɛntɛgɛde i bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Na fan mu gɛ a xa masenyi ra, xɛɛra gbɛtɛ naxa fa, a a fala Ayuba bɛ, «I xa die to nu na xulunyi tife e taara xɔnyi. <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />Foye belebele faxi na tɛmui nɛ keli gbengberenyi ma, a banxi rabira i xa die ma. E birin bara faxa. N keren peti nan kisixi. N faxi na nan dɛntɛgɛde i bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Na kui Ayuba naxa keli, a a xa donma ibɔɔ a ma, a a xunyi bi sunnunyi ma, a fa a rafelen bɔxi ma. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />A naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">«N faxi duniɲa n mageli nan na n bari tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">n man gbilenma n mageli nan na n siga tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Alatala bara n ki harige ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Alatala man bara na harige ba n yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Tantui na Ala bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Na birin kui, Ayuba mu yunubi yo raba, a mu fe kobi yo fala Ala bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Alatala nun Sentanɛ xa dɛ masarɛ firin nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Lɔxɔɛ nde Alatala xa malekɛe man naxa fa a yire, Sentanɛ man nu na e tagi. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Alatala naxa Sentanɛ maxɔrin, «I kelixi minden?» Sentanɛ naxa a yaabi, «N kelixi duniɲa iɲɛrɛde.» <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Alatala man naxa a maxɔrin, «I bara n ma konyi Ayuba rakɔrɔsi? A maniyɛ yo mu na duniɲa ma. A fan, a tinxin. Ala yaragaaxui nan a ra, fe ɲaaxi mu rafan a ma. Han ya a xa tinxinyi mu masara, hali i to waxi n xa a halaki tun.» <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Sentanɛ naxa a yaabi, «Adama fe birin nabama a fate xa tɔɔrɛ matangafe nan na. A nɔma a harige birin masarade yalanyi ra. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Xa i a fate yati tɔɔrɔma, a i dankama nɛ keren na.» <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Alatala naxa a fala Sentanɛ bɛ, «Awa yire, n bara a fate sa i sagoe, kɔnɔ i naxa a faxa de.»<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Na tɛmui Sentanɛ naxa keli Alatala yire. A naxa suurie ikonkon Ayuba fate birin ma, keli a sanyi kui ma han a xuntagi. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ayuba naxa dɔxɔ tɛ xube xɔɔra sunnunyi kui, a nu a fate xɔɔlin fɛɲɛ kebele ra. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />A xa ginɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «Han ya i na i xa tinxinyi kui? Ala rasɔtɔ sɔnɔn, i xa faxa.» <verse eid="JOB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Kɔnɔ Ayuba naxa a yaabi, «I wɔyɛnfe nɛ na ki alɔ xaxilitare. Xa won tinma Ala xa hɛri ra, a mu lanma won xa tin a xa xɔrɔxɔɛ fan na?» Na kui Ayuba mu yunubi yo sɔtɔ a xa wɔyɛnyie kui.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayuba nun a boore saxanyie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Ayuba boore saxanyie to a xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe mɛ, e naxa keli e xɔnyi sigafe ra Ayuba yire. E xili: Elifasi Temanka, Bilidada Suuxaka, nun Sofara Naamaka. E naxa lu yire keren, e lan fe keren ma, e xa sa Ayuba kunfa ba, e xa a madundu. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />E to sa a to keli yire makuye, e naxa san a ma, e bɔnbɔ gbelegbelefe ra. E naxa e xa donmae ibɔɔ e ma, e xube maso e ma sunnunyi kui. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />E naxa dɔxɔ Ayuba sɛɛti ma bɔxi, han xi solofere. Mixi yo mu wɔyɛn keren fala a bɛ, barima e a to nɛ, a xa tɔɔrɛ nu gbo ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba nimisafe a xa bari ra»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Na birin to dangi, Ayuba naxa a bari lɔxɔɛ danka <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />yi masenyi ra:<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />«N bari lɔxɔɛ xa nɛɛmu duniɲa ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">Na kɔɛ ra e naxɛ, ‹Di xɛmɛ na a ra.›<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Ala xa na lɔxɔɛ findi dimi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">na lɔxɔɛ xa nɛɛmu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">a xa tɔnyi dɔxɔ soge yanbafe ra na lɔxɔɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Ala xa na lɔxɔɛ findi dimi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">a xa nuxui ifɔɔrɛ dusu a xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">a xa lu dimi magaaxuxi kui.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Ala xa na kɔɛ ifɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">a xa na ba kɔnti ra ɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">a xa na ba kɔnti ra kike kui.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Ala xa na kɔɛ kuma di ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">sɛɛwɛ xui yo naxa ite.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />A xa findi dankɛ ti se ra mandurulae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">naxee ninginangɛ xilima.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Na lɔxɔɛ subaxɛ tunbuie naxa yanba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">kuye naxa iba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">naiyalanyi yo naxa mini,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />barima a mu sese raba naxan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">nu nɔma n barife dande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">naxan nu nɔma n nɔxunde n ma tɔɔrɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Munfe ra n nga furi mu bira nu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Munfe ra n mu faxa nu beenu n xa bari?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Munfe ra n nga n nasɛnɛxi a san ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">a xiɲɛ fi n ma?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Xa na mu a ra, yi tɛmui n bɛlɛxi bɔɲɛsa kui nu<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />mangɛe nun rasimae fɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">naxee xa banxie bara gɛ kanade,<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />naxee nu bara xɛɛma nun gbeti gbegbe sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Munfe ra e mu n nagata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">alɔ diyɔrɛ naxan mu waxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">naxan mu mini kɛnɛ ma?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Gaburi tan kui, mixi ɲaaxie mu nɔma sese ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">mixi taganxie e malabuma nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Konyie bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">e mu e kanyi xui mɛma gaburi kui.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Dimɛdie nun forie na mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">konyie e yɛtɛ sɔtɔma naa.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Munfe ra Ala a niyama adamadie xa mini kɛnɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">naxee findi tɔɔrɔmixie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">naxee nimisaxi e xa duniɲɛigiri kui,<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />naxee faxɛ xɔli mawama, kɔnɔ e mu faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">naxee faxɛ fenma dangi naafuli ra,<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />naxee ɲɛlɛxinma gaburi life ra?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Munfe ra mixi barima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">Ala kira balanxi naxan ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">Ala naxan naxɛtɛnma yire birin?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />N ma donse findixi n ma tɔɔrɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">n ma minse findixi n yaye nan na.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />N na gaaxu fe naxan na, na nan n lima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">Fe naxan na n nasɛrɛn, n na nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Bɔɲɛsa mu na n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">n mu nɔma n sabaride.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">Malabui mu na n bɛ, fo tɔɔrɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elifasi Temanka xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="s2">«Tinxintɔɛ mu tɔɔrɔma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Elifasi Temanka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />«Ayuba, i haakɛ to n bɛ n xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">N mu nɔma dundude.<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />I bara mixi gbegbe xaran,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">i bara e ralimaniya.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />I xa masenyie bara mixie mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">i xa wɔyɛnyie bara e sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Yakɔsi i tan nan to fa na tɔɔrɔfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">limaniya bara ba i tan yi.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />I mu i xaxili ti i xa danxaniya ra Ala ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">I mu lama i xa tinxinyi ra?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />I bara mixi fanyi to halakixi tɔɔrɛ ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Tinxintɔɛ nɔma bɔnɔde?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />N naxan nakɔrɔsixi, fe ɲaaxi rabae nan tɔɔrɔma.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Ala e xun nakanama a xa xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Yɛtɛ xa yirindinyi nun baratɛ xa ɲarandanyi magaaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">kɔnɔ e ɲinyie fama nɛ magirade.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Yɛtɛ yati faxama kaamɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">a xa die yensen yɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />«Masenyi nde bara fala n bɛ a gundo ki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">n tuli bara a makɔlikɔli xui mɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Xiye sa tɛmui kɔɛ tagi,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />gaaxui naxa n suxu han n fate naxa sɛrɛn.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Tubari nde naxa dangi n ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">N fate xabee naxa keli, e ti.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Tubari nu tixi naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">N a to nɛ, kɔnɔ mixi yo a ra n mu a kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">N bara mixi maniyɛ tan to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">N naxa xui nde mɛ yi makɔlikɔli ra,<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‹Adamadi tinxin Ala ya i? A sɛniyɛn a Marigi ya i?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Xa Ala mu la a xa malekɛe ra a xa walikɛe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">xa a tantanyi toma nee ma,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />ibunadama go, naxan yailanxi bɛndɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">naxan nɔma iwurude alɔ kaari?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Adamadie faxama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, sese mu na kanama.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />E xa simaya luuti bolonma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">e faxa fahaamutareɲa kui.›»<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="s1">Elifasi Temanka xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba, Ala maxandi»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />«Yakɔsi, i xa xili ti i xui itexi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Nde i yaabima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">I sɛniyɛntɔɛ mundun xilima?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Gbɛsɛnxɔnnɛya xaxilitare faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">tɔɔnɛ lɔnnitare halakima nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />N bara xaxilitare nde to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">a xa fe sɔɔnɛyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">kɔnɔ na ikɔrɛxi ra n naxa yi dankɛ bira a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />‹Mali birin xa ba a xa die yi ra, kiiti xa kana e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">mixi yo naxa e mali na kui.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Kaamɛtɔɛe xa a xa xɛ don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">e xa baloe birin ba a yi ra hali naxan na tunbe xɔɔra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">Mixie xa mila a xa naafuli ma, e xa a ba a yi.›<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Tɔɔrɛ nun ɲaxankatɛ fama nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Adamadi tɔɔrɔma nɛ a xa duniɲɛigiri kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">Na mu kanama, alɔ tɛ na radɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">a fulefule tefe fan to mu kanama.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Xa n tan nan a ra nu, n Alatala nan maxandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">n nan n ma tɔɔrɛ masen a bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />A kaabanakoe rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">a xa fe xungbee mu kɔntima.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />A tunɛ ragoro bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">a ye rasiga xɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />A tɔɔrɔmixi xa fe itema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">a mixi sunnunxi rakisima.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />A mixi kɔɔtaxi xa fe xun nakanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">alako e waxɔnfe naxa sɔɔnɛya.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />A mixi madaxui suxuma gantanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">a yanfante waxɔnfe kanama.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />E xa yanyi findima e bɛ dimi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">e luma alɔ dɔnxui naxee mu se toma.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Alatala tɔɔrɔmixi ratangama wɔyɛn xɔrɔxɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">naxan kelima yanfantee dɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">A e ratangama sɛnbɛma xa fe ɲaaxi ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Xaxili tide luma nɛ tɔɔrɔmixi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">Tinxintare dɛ balanma nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na adama bɛ Ala naxan xuruma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Wo naxa tondi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi xa xurui ra,<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />barima a fi naxan sama mixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">a na fan dandanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">a fe xɔnɛ naxan naminima, a na rayalanma.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />A mu tondima i ratangade tɔɔrɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">a i rakisima tɔɔrɛ birin kui.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Kaamɛ na sin bɔxi ma, a i ratangama nɛ faxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">gere na mini, a i ratangama santidɛgɛma ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />A i ratangama nɛ wɔyɛn ɲaaxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">a i ba gbaloe kui.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />I mu gaaxuma kaamɛ ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">i mu sɛrɛnma sube xaaɲɛ ya ra,<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />barima saatɛ luma nɛ i nun duniɲa kui isee tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">gɛmɛe nun subee mu i tɔɔrɔma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Bɔɲɛsa luma nɛ i xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">muɲɛ yo mu tima i xa gɔɔrɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />I xa die wuyama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">i bɔnsɔɛ gboma nɛ alɔ burunyi sɛxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />I mu gaburi lima, i xa simaya mu kamalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">alɔ maale fan to mu xabama a xaba tɛmui mu a lixi.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Muxu bara yi nɔndi kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">i fan xa a ramɛ, i xa a fahaamu.»<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="s2">«N ma tɔɔrɛ gbo n ma fe ɲaaxie bɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />«Xa n ma tɔɔrɛ sa maniyama nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">xa a sa sama sikeeli ma nu,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />a binyɛ dangima nɛ baa mɛyɛnyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">Na nan a toxi yusi yo mu na n ma wɔyɛnyie ma.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi xa tanbɛ bara n sɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">na xɔnɛ bara te n xaxili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Ala na n gerefe a ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Ɲooge fanxi dɛnnaxɛ, sofale wama mɛnni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">Ninge wa xui mɛɛma a xa donse ya i?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Bande donma fɔxɛ xanbi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Tɔxɛlɛ ɲintare ɲɔxun?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />N mu nu wama naxan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">na bara findi n baloe ra hali na fa kanaxi.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Ala xa n ma dubɛ suxu n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">a xa n waxɔnfe rakamali.<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Ala xa n xun nakana, a xa n faxa.<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Na kui, n madundui sɔtɔma nɛ, hali n to yi tɔɔrɛ birin kolonxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">n sɛɛwa n to mu gbilen Ala Sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa yaamari fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />N nan n xaxili tima sɛnbɛ mundun na fa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">N ma diɲɛ munse fanma n ma sɔnɔn?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />N sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ fanye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">N fate xɔrɔxɔ alɔ wure?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Nde nɔma n malide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">Sɛnbɛ mundun luxi n ma?»<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />«Tɔɔrɔmixi hayi na a dugutɛgɛ xa mali ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">hali na mu sa gaaxuma Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />N ngaxakerenyie bara n yanfa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">alɔ xure naxan xɔrima.<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Ɲɛmɛ tɛmui, ye banbaran yɛ, a radunda,<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />kɔnɔ sogofure ra, ye birin xɔri.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Biyaasilae kira bama a ma ye fenfe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">e fa lɔɛ gbengberen yire.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Tema Biyaasilae e xun tima ye yire ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">Seebakae fan e xaxili tima na xure ra,<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />kɔnɔ e na mɛnni li, e xure xɔrixi nan toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">Na kui limaniya bama nɛ e yi ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Wo luxi na ki nɛ n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">Wo bara gaaxu n ma tɔɔrɛ ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />N xoro nu, n nu wo makula nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">wo xa n xun sara wo xa naafuli nde ra?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />N wo makula nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">wo xa n xun sara n yaxui gbeeli nde ma?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Wo n xaran.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">Wo n ma tantanyi masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">alako n xa n sabari.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Nɔndi tan mu mixi yo tɔɔrɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Kɔnɔ wo xa masenyie tan fala xun?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Wo bara kiiti sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">wo mu wo tuli matixi tɔɔrɔmixi tan xa wɔyɛnyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Wo fata kiiti ɲaaxi sade kiridie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">Wo mu yanfanteya ba wo boore yɛtɛ yati ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Kɔsi fa yandi, wo wo ya ti n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">N mu wule falama wo bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Wo xa kiiti tinxinxi sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">alako n xili fanyi naxa kana.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Wo fe falɛ ɲaaxi mɛma n na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">N mu fata fe fanyi nun fe ɲaaxi tagi rasade?»<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi singe dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«A a mawafe Ala bɛ»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />«Mixi xa fe mu luxi xɛ duniɲa ma alɔ sɔɔri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">A xa duniɲɛigiri mu luxi xɛ alɔ walikɛ?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Konyi gbatama kɔɛ xa so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">walikɛ gbatama a sare ra.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />N tan fan, n kɛ bara findi tɔɔrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">n ma wali sare bara findi xɔnɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />N nɛ n sama, n lu ra a manɛ, ‹N kelima tɛmui mundun?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Xixɔli mu n tan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">tɔɔrɛ nan tun a ra kɔɛ birin kui.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Kuli dinfe n fate ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">n kiri na bɔrɔfe, yalee tife a ma.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />N ma simaya xulun mabɔɛ xa mabɔɛ wuri bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Ala, i xa ratu a ma n ma simaya ɲɛngi nan tun a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">n yae mu fe fanyi toma kɔrɛ.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Ya naxan tixi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">na mu n toma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">a gbe mu luxi n xa lɔɛ i ma.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Kunda na te, a man lɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">Adamadi fan na siga aligiyama, a mu gbilenma fa ra.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />A mu gbilenma a xɔnyi sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">a xa fɔxɔɛ mu ratuma a xa fe ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Na nan a toxi n mu n dɛ suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">n nan n ma tɔɔrɛ ifalama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">n nan n mawa n ma xɔrɔrɔɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />N findixi i bɛ baa nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">xa na mu a ra, daalise xun solofere kanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">i to fa biraxi n ma fe fɔxɔ ra yi mɔɔli ra?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />N na a fala, ‹N xa n sa, n xa xi, alako n xa n ma tɔɔrɛ mayanfa,›<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />i n magaaxu xiye nun laamatunyi ɲaaxie ra.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Faxɛ nan tun xɔli fa n ma to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">dangi yi xɔrie ra naxee luxi n bɛ yi ki.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />N ma simaya bara raɲaaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">n mu wama bufe duniɲa ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">N bɛɲin, n nii tide mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Munse na adama ra naxan a niyama i xa i ɲɔxɔ sa a xɔn ma,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />i nu a mato tɛmui birin?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />I i yae bama n na tɛmui mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">I n luma n yɛtɛ ra mun lɔxɔɛ?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Xa n bara yunubi raba i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">na fala n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">i tan naxan adamadi matoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">N tan yegetixi i yi ra munfe ra matoe ra?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Munfe ra i mu diɲɛ n ma fe kobi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Munfe ra i mu n ma yunubi xafari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">A gbe mu luxi n xa findi bɛndɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Na tɛmui i mu n toma sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bilidada Suuxaka xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="s2">«Haakɛ mu sigama Aligiyama.»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Bilidada Suuxaka naxa a masen,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />«I yi wɔyɛnyi mɔɔli falama han tɛmui mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">I xa wɔyɛnyi luxi nɛ alɔ foye.<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Ala nɔma nɔndi mafindide wule ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nɔma tinxinyi ifude?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Xa i xa die yunubi nan nabaxi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">a e ɲaxankataxi na nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Xa i tan Ala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">xa i Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi makulama,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />xa yunubi mu na i ma, xa i tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">Ala a ɲɛngi sama nɛ i xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">a i rasabati i xa tinxinyi kui.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />I harige dɔnxɔɛ fama dangide na singe ra.»<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />«Fahaamui fen won babae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">i xa xaxili sɔtɔ nee benbae fan na.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Won tan mu buxi duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">xaxili xɔnkuye mu na won bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />E mu fahaamui fima xɛ i ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">E e xaxili xa masenyie tima i bɛ yi ki:<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Wofiri bulama xare ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">Xure i baare findima a ra ye mu dɛnnaxɛ?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Hali a na a bili ma, a mu xabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">a lisima mafuren dangi ɲooge birin na.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Na nan fama rabade mixie ra, naxee nɛɛmuma Ala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">Tinxintare xaxili tide ɲɔnma na ki nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />A xaxili tide bara kana, alɔ mixi naxan a kilɔnma sayɛlɛ tɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />A na a kilɔn na ra, a kanama nɛ, a kanyi bira.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />A luma alɔ sansi, ye naxan kui rafexi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">a a salonyi iyan soge linlinyi ya ma laakɔɛ xun ma,<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />a a sankee sɔti gɛmɛ malanxi longori ra.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Xa i na sansi tala naa, a lisima nɛ,<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />a mu fanma mɛnni sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">Sansi gbɛtɛ man fa bula a nu na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Ala mu tinxintɔɛ rawɔlɛma, a mu tinxintare sɛnbɛ soma.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />A gbe mu luxi a xa i rasɛɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">i xa matɔxɔɛ falɛ ra i fama naxan tide.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />I xɔnmixie fama lude yaagi kui, e xɔnyie fa bira.»<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala xa kiiti xɔrɔxɔ»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />«N na birin kolonxi nɔndi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Ala nɔma nɔndi fide adama ma di?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Xa Ala na kiiti safe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">adama tan mu nɔma a dɛ tongode a kanke ra.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />A tan nan gbe na lɔnni nun sɛnbɛ ra, nde nɔma tide a kanke?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Ala nɔma geyae talade e tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">a e mafindi a xa xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />A nɔma bɔxi bunyi rasɛrɛnde, a a bɔɔ a ra.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />A nɔma soge nun tunbuie ifɔɔrɔde.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />A tan nan koore itala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">a a ɲɛrɛ baa mɔrɔnyie fari.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />A tan nan tunbui birin sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">kankan na a yire.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />A bara fe xungbee raba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">won mu nɔma naxee fahaamude.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">A xa kaabanakoe mu nɔma kɔntide.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />A nɔma dangide n sɛɛti ma, n mu a to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">A lɔɛ, n mu nɔ a tode.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Nde nɔma a xa se tongoxi ragbilende?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Nde nɔma a falade a bɛ, ‹I na munse rabafe?›<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Ala mu gbilenma a xa xɔnɛ fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">Yɛtɛ igboe xaxili tide birin birama a ya i.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />N tan, n a yaabima di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">N wɔyɛn mɔɔli mundun falama a bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Hali nɔndi sa na n bɛ, n mu nɔma tide a kanke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">N ma kiitisa madiɲɛfe nan tun luma n yi.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Xa n sa a xili, a naxa n yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">n mu lama a ra a bara a tuli mati n na,<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />barima a bara n tɔɔrɔ a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">a bara n ɲaxankata na ki tun.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />A mu n luma n xa malabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">a bara n ma xɔnɛ xun masa a ɲaaxi ra<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />N mu nɔma a ra, barima a sɛnbɛ gbo n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Muxu nun Ala mu nɔma makiitide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">barima kiitisa mu na muxu tagi.<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Hali n sa tinxin nu, n dɛ mu nɔndi fima n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">Hali yunubi mu na n ma nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">n dɛ kiiti rakanama nɛ n na.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Yunubi na n ma? N mu a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">N nimisaxi n ma duniɲɛigiri nan tun na.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />N tan bɛ, a birin keren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">barima Ala tinxintɔɛ nun tinxintare birin ɲaxankatama.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Gbaloe na tinxintɔɛ li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">Ala mu na tɔɔrɛ toma.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Tinxintare na bɔxi nde sɔtɔ tinxintareya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Ala a niyama kiitisae xa tin na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Xa Ala mu a ra, nde a ra fa?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />N ma simaya xulun gila bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">A ɲɔnma beenun n xa hɛɛri sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />N ma simaya dangima alɔ kunkui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">alɔ sɛgɛ naxan goroma tɔxɛyɔrɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />N na a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">‹N xa nɛɛmu n ma mawa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">n xa ba sunnunxi, n xa n sɛnbɛ so,›<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />n ma tɔɔrɛ nan birin luma n magaaxu ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">N a kolon i mu nɔndi fima n ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />N to bara yunubi sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">n nɔndi fenma n yɛtɛ bɛ munfe ra?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Hali n sa n maxa nɛ ye tinsexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">hali n sa n bɛlɛxɛe maxa xɔsi ba se ra,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />i n nagoroma nɛ boora,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">n xa raɲaaxu n ma dugie ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Ala mu luxi alɔ adamadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">n nɔma naxan xilide kiiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">alako n xa n gbe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">kiitisa xa kiiti sa muxu tagi.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Kiitisa yo mu na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">naxan nɔma kiiti sade n nun Ala tagi.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Ala xa a xa wuri bɔnbɔ ti se ba n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">a xa a xa fe magaaxuxi ba n yi ra,<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />alako n xa nɔ wɔyɛnde a ra gaaxutareɲa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">Kɔnɔ n ma fe to mu na ki xɛ, n xa lu n keren.»<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi firin nde dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba maxɔrinyi tife Ala ma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />«N ma duniɲɛigiri bara raɲaaxu n nii ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Na kui n xa n gbe fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Xɔnɛ naxan na n furi kui, n xa na makɛnɛn.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />N bara a fala Ala bɛ, I naxa n suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">I xa n nakolon i n suxuxi fe naxan ma.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />N tɔɔrɔfe rafan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">n tan naxan findixi i xa daalise ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">Tinxintare waxɔnfe rafan i ma?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />I fe to ki mu makuya adamadi fe to ki ra?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />I xa simaya maniya adamadi gbe ra?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />I n tɔɔrɔfe munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">I na n ma yunubie fenfe munfe ra?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />I ɲan n ma tinxinyi kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">i ɲan a kolon mixi yo mu n natangama i bɛlɛxɛ i.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />I tan nan n daaxi, i tan nan n sɔntɔma.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />I xa ratu a ma a i n daaxi bɛndɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">I man wama n nagbilenfe mɛnni nɛ?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />I bara n yailan alɔ mixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">naxan xiɲɛ yailanma donse fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />I bara n fate birin yailan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">kiri, sube, xɔri, nun fasɛ.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />I bara n ma simaya xɔn kuya, i bara hinnɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">i bara i ɲɛngi sa n nii xɔn ma.»<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />«Kɔnɔ yakɔsi n bara a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">naxan nu na i xaxili ma n ma fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />I bara wa n ma yunubi tofe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">alako i xa tondi diɲɛde n ma.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Xa yunubi na n ma, ɲaxankatɛ na n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Xa yunubi mu na n ma, n na yaagi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">n mu nɔma n xunyi yati rakelide.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Xa n sa n xunyi rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">i n bɔnbɔma i sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">alɔ yɛtɛ sɛnbɛma a rabama ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />I xa xɔnɛ na xun masafe n ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">i xa ɲaxankatɛ bara gbo yɛ.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />I n naminixi n nga tɛɛgɛ i munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Xa n sa faxa naa nɛ nu, mixi yo mu nu n toma,<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />n mu baloma nu, n nu tongoma nɛ n nga tɛɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">n nagoro gaburi kui keren na.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Naxan luxi n ma simaya ra, a mu gbo sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">Yandi, i xa gbilen n fɔxɔ ra fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">sɛɛwɛ dondoronti xa lu n bɛ<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />beenu n xa siga aligiyama, dimi na dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">N mu gbilenma duniɲa ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />Dimi xungbe na aligiyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">Adama xaxili ifuma naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">Mɛnni naiyalanyi yati nan findima dimi ra.»<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sofara xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba, i xa tuubi Ala ma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Sofara Naamaka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />«A mu lan mixi xa i xa yi masenyi gbegbe yaabi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Masenyi ratofanxi mu nɔndi fima masenyi ma.<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />I ɲɔxɔ a ma a mixi dunduma i xa wɔyɛnyie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">i xa yo Ala ma, mixi yo mu i rayaagi?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />I naxɛ, ‹Sese mu luxi n ma lɔnni ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">n bara sɛniyɛn Ala ya i.›<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Xa Ala sa wɔyɛn i bɛ nu,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />a a xa lɔnni gundo masenma nɛ i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">naxan dangima adamadi xa fe to ki ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />I nɔma Ala xa tilinyi kolonde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">I nɔma Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi xaxili birin fahaamude?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Na lɔnni ite koore xa maite bɛ, a tilin aligiyama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">I nɔma sode na kui?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />A kuya bɔxi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">a xa gboe dangi baa ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Xa Ala sa mixi suxu, a fa a makiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">nɔndi luma na kanyi bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Ala mixi ɲaaxie kolonma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">a tinxintaree toma.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Xaxilitare mu nɔma findide lɔnnila ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">alɔ sofale fan to mu nɔma findide adamadi ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Xa i tan i yɛtɛ ragbilen Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">xa i i bɛlɛxɛ itala a bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />xa i gbilen tinxintareya fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">xa i a matanga i xa denbaya kui,<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />na kui i xunnakeli sɔtɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">i sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ, i limaniya a fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Na tɛmui i nɛɛmuma nɛ i xa tɔɔrɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">alɔ xure naxan bara dangi a rakuya.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />I xa duniɲɛigiri yanbama nɛ alɔ soge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">i xa dimi bama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">a lu alɔ kuye na iba.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />I bɔɲɛ a raxarama nɛ, xaxili tide lu i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">fe ɲaaxi a makuyama nɛ i ra, i xi xɔli fanyi raba.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />I na i sa, mixi yo mu i xa xi xɔli kanama i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">Mixie fama nɛ i xa hinnɛ e ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Kɔnɔ tinxintaree xa fe xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">e mu kisima, faxɛ nan e mamɛxi.»<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi saxan nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Daalise birin na Ala xɔnyɛ i.»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />«Duniɲa xui nan na wo kɔn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">A luxi nɛ yi ki alɔ lɔnni birin na wo tan gbansan yi ra.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Kɔnɔ n tan fan, xaxili na n bɛ alɔ wo tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Wo mu fisa n bɛ de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Wo naxan falaxi, nde mu nɔma na kolonde?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />N na Ala maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">alako n xa yaabi nde sɔtɔ a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">tinxintɔɛ findi a booree bɛ mayele se ra.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Mixie naxee mu na tɔɔrɛ kui, e yoma tɔɔrɔmixi xa tɔɔrɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">E a falama e nun na tɔɔrɛ nan lan.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Kɔntɔfili yo mu na muɲɛtie xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">Kuye batuie Ala xili maberema, kɔnɔ e bɔɲɛ saxi.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Maxɔrinyi ti subee ma wula i, e xa i ralɔnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">Xɔnie fan xa na masen i bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Bɔxi mato, na fan xa findi lɔnni ra i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">Yɛxɛe maxɔrin baa ma, nee fan xa na masen i bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />E birin a kolon Alatala fɔxi nan na ki.<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Daalise birin nii na a xɔnyɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">adamadi birin ɲɛngi fatanxi a tan nan na.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Adama xa a ɲɔxɔ sa yi masenyie xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">alɔ a dɛ a ɲɔxɔ sama donse xɔn ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Lɔnni na forie yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">simaya xɔnkuye nan xaxili fima mixi ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Lɔnni nun sɛnbɛ na Ala nan yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">marasi nun xaxili fanyi na a tan nan bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Xa Ala se kana, a mu nɔma rafalade sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">Xa a tan nan mixi balanxi, na kanyi mu minima.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Xa Ala kankan tunɛ ma, se birin xarama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">Xa a a bɛɲin, a banbaran yɛ bɔxi ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Sɛnbɛ nun nɔndi na a tan nan yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">Mixi naxan madaxuxi nun mixi madaxui, e birin a gbe.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />A nɔma marasimae suxude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">a nɔma kiitisae xaxili ifude.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Mangɛ yɔlɔnxɔnyi naxan saxi mixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">Ala na bama nɛ e ma, a a sa mangɛ tan ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Ala sɛrɛxɛdubɛe xaninma konyiya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">a mangasanyi rabira.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />A masenyi bama marasimae yi, a forie xa lɔnni mafindima.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />A kuntigie rayaagima, a sɛnbɛmae igoroma.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />A gundoe makɛnɛnma, a dimi findi naiyalanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />A ɲamanɛe xun nakelima, a man e xun nakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">A e rasiga, a man e rafa.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />A xaxili bama ɲamanɛe mangɛe yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">a e ralɔɛ gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />E luma alɔ dɔnxuie naxee mu naiyalanyi toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">e luma alɔ siisilae kira ifuma naxee ma.»<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi saxan nde dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Daalise birin na Ala xɔnyɛ i»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />«Iyo, n ya bara na birin to, n tuli bara na mɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Wo naxan kolon, n tan fan na kolon. Wo mu fisa n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />N tan wama nɛ gbansan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">n xa wɔyɛn Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">n wama n yɛtɛ nan xun mafalafe a bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Wo tan bara n tɔɔɲɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">Wo mu faxi seri yo ra n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Xa wo wo sabarixi nɛ nu, na nan fisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">Na nu nɔma findide nɛ lɔnni ra.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Wo xa wo tuli mati n ma masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">wo xa n xunmafala wɔyɛnyie ramɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Wo tan wama wɔyɛn tinxintaree nan falafe Ala xili ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">Wo wama wule nan falafe wo Marigi xili ra?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Wo wama Ala malife nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Wo wama Ala nan xun mafalafe?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Wo munse rabama xa a sa wo sondonyie mato?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Wo nɔma Ala madaxude alɔ wo mixi madaxuma ki naxɛ?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />N a kolon, a wo rakɔrɔsima nɛ xa wo tantanma wo xa gundoe kui.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Wo mu gaaxuma a sɛnbɛ ya ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">Wo mu gaaxuma a xa xɔnɛ ya ra?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Wo xa masenyie luma alɔ tɛ xube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">wo makanta see sɛnbɛ mu na.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Wo wo sabari, wo a lu n xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">Fe naxan n lima, na n lima nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />N suusaxi n yɛtɛ raminide kɛnɛ ma munfe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">hali na to nɔma findide nɛ faxɛ ra n bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Hali Ala n faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">n nan n xaxili tima a tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">N nan n yɛtɛ xun mafalama a tan nan ya i.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Na yati nɔma findide kisi ra n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">barima tinxintare mu suusama tide a ya i.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Wo n ma masenyie ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">wo wo tuli mati e ra.»<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />«Wo a lu n xa n gbe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">n a kolon nɔndi luma nɛ n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Nde nɔma n ma yunubi masende n bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Xa na raba, n dunduma nɛ, n tin faxafe ra.»<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />«Ala, fe firin gbansan naba n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">alako n naxa nɔxun i ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />I xɔnyɛ ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">i man xa ba n magaaxufe.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Na tɛmui n xili fa, n i yaabima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">xa na mu a ra n nɔma nɛ wɔyɛnde, i n yaabi.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />N ma yunubi nun n ma fe ɲaaxi xasabi lanxi munse ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">N ma yunubi nun n ma fe ɲaaxi masen n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />I mɛɛxi n na munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">I n findixi i yaxui ra munfe ra?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />I wama sɛnbɛ xuri kanyi nan nasɛrɛnfe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">I wama birafe mixi xurudi nan fɔxɔ ra?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />I bara n ɲaxankata a ɲaaxi ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">n ma yunubie xa fe ra n naxee rabaxi n fonike tɛmui ra.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />I yɔlɔnxɔnyi nan saxi n sanyie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">alako i xa n ɲɛrɛ ki birin kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">i xa naaninyi sa n ma ɲɛrɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />N fate na bɔrɔfe nɛ yi ki, alɔ dugi xiyee naxan xinxi.»<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi naani nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Adama xa duniɲɛigiri xɔrɔxɔ»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />«Adama, ginɛ bari di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">a xa simaya dunke, kɔntɔfili gbo a ma.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />A luxi nɛ alɔ fuge naxan minima, a fa xaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">A luxi nɛ alɔ niini naxan mu buma.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />I wama n maniyafe na nan na, i xa n makiiti?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Nde nɔma sɛniyɛnyi raminide sɛniyɛntareɲa kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Mixi yo!<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Xa i tan nan mixi xa simaya kɔnti ragirixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">xa i tan nan natɛ tongoxi a xa simaya kɔnti dande ma,<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />i xa gbilen a fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">alako a xa a malabu alɔ walikɛ a malabuma ki naxɛ wali raɲɔnyi.»<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />«Xa wuri bili na a ra nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">a na xaba, a xuntunyi man gbilenma nɛ ɲingi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">a salonyie man fan.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Xa a sanke sa bu bɔxi bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">a xuntunyi tan naxa faxa bɛndɛ kui,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />tunɛ birɛ, a man nɔma findide a ra alɔ a singe.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Kɔnɔ adamadi tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">xa a faxa, a sɛnbɛ birin ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">a mu baloxi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Baa nun xure nɔma xɔride,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />kɔnɔ adamadi laaxiraxi mu kelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">fo koore xa ɲɔn, a fa xunu.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />A xɔli n ma i xa n nɔxun aligiyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">han i xa xɔnɛ dangima tɛmui naxɛ, i fa ratu n ma.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Kɔnɔ Adama na faxa, a man gbilenma balo ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">N mamɛ tima nɛ n ma wali kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">han n ɲɔxɔɛ fa tɛmui.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />I na n xili, n fama i xa xili ratinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">barima i wama nɛ i xa daali xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Yakɔsi i n sanyi tongo ki birin igbɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">I mu n ma yunubie toma.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />N ma fe ɲaaxie nɔxun bɛki kui, n ma yunubie xafari!»<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />«Kɔnɔ geya birama a yensen yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">fanye tala a yire,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />ye kira rabɔɔ gɛmɛe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">a bɔxi bɛndɛ xanin a xun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">I fan adamadi xaxili tide rabama na ki nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />I nɔma adama ra, a fa faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">I na gɛ a tɔɔrɔde, i a xanin aligiyama.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Xa a xa die binyɛ sɔtɔma, a mu na kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">Xa binyɛ bama e ma, a mu na toma.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Adama xa tɔɔrɛ gbo duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">a bɔɲɛ luma sunnunyi kui.»<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Elifasi Temanka xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba xa wɔyɛnyi mu fan»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Elifasi Temanka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />«Lɔnnila xa yaabi nɔma maniyade foye ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">A yɛtɛ igboma na nan na?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />A nɔma a xun mafalade wɔyɛnyi fufafu ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">A nɔma masenyi falade naxan tide mu na?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />I na binyɛ bafe Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">i na limaniya bafe mixie yi ra Ala batufe ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />I xa fe ɲaaxi nan a niyafe i xa wɔyɛn na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">I wama mixie madaxufe i dɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />I dɛ yati nan findixi seede ra i xa fe ɲaaxie ma. N tan mu a ra.»<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />«Adama singe i tan nan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">I singe daa geyae bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />I Ala xa gundo ramɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">alako i xa lɔnni sɔtɔ i yɛtɛ kan bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />I munse kolon muxu tan mu naxan kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">I fahaamui mundun sɔtɔxi muxu tan mu naxan sɔtɔxi?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Forie na muxu ya ma naxee fori i baba bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />I mu limaniya sɔtɔ Ala xa masenyie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">muxu naxee fala i bɛ marafanyi ra?»<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />«I bɔɲɛ texi munfe ra, han i ya bara gbeeli a i,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />i dɛ nu fa wɔyɛnyie fala xɔnɛ kui Ala bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Adamadi sɛniyɛn? Ginɛ bari di tinxin?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Xa Ala mu lama a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">xa koore yati mu sɛniyɛn Ala ya i,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />adamadi go, naxan bara kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">naxan fe ɲaaxi rabama tɛmui birin?»<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />«I tuli mati n na, n xa na tagi raba i bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">N fe naxan toxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">n xa na fala i bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />lɔnnilae naxan masenxi, e naxan sɔtɔ e babae ra e mu a nɔxun.<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Ala bɔxi fixi e tan nan ma, xɔɲɛ gbɛtɛ yo mu nu na sinden.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Mixi ɲaaxi tɔɔrɔma nɛ a xa simaya birin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">kɔnti saxi a xa simaya ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />A halaki fe mɛma, muɲɛtie baganma a ma, e a xa bɔɲɛsa kana.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />A a kolon a mu kisima, santidɛgɛma na a mamɛfe.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />A a lintanma balo fende, a a kolon a mu ratangama dimi ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Tɔɔrɛ nun kɔntɔfili bara a magaaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">e gere tima alɔ mangɛ nun a xa sɔɔrie,<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />barima a bara a yɛtɛ igbo Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">a bara suusa Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />A bara suusa Ala gerede a xa wure lefae bun ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />A bara xungbo han a furi xalɛ bara dɔxɔ,<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />kɔnɔ a fama sabatide taa kanaxie nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">naxee na birafe, mixie mu na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />A xa naafuli ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">a xa bannaya kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">Barakɛ mu luma a xa se sɔtɔɛ ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />A mu nɔma kelide dimi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">A bɔnsɔɛ fama gande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">a sɔntɔ Ala kɛrɛ foye ra.»<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />«Xa a xaxili tima fe fufafu ra, a fe fufafu nan sɔtɔma.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Beenun a xa simaya xa kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">a fama ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔde.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />A luma alɔ sansi bogi naxee bama e xinde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">alɔ sansi fuge naxee birama.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Tinxintare xa denbaya mu gboma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">mixi naxee kɔbiri rasuxuma tinxintareya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">e xa banxie ganma nɛ tɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Fe ɲaaxi maɲɔxunfe findima tɔɔrɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">Na maɲɔxunyi fama a kanyi yanfade.»<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi suuli nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba xa seede na koore ma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />«N bara wo xa masenyi maniyɛ gbegbe mɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">Wo mu fata mixi madundude.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Wo xa masenyie maniya foye ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">E ɲɔnma tɛmui mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">N ma yaabie bara wo raxɔnɔ?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Xa wo tan nan nu na tɔɔrɔfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">n tan fan nu nɔma wɔyɛnde nɛ alɔ wo tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">n wo tɔɔɲɛgɛ, n yo wo ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Kɔnɔ n tan mu nu na rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">n wo sɛnbɛ soma n ma wɔyɛnyie nan na nu, n dɛ wo ralimaniya.»<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />«N ma wɔyɛnyi mu n ma tɔɔrɛ bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">n ma sabari fan mu a makuyama n na.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Yakɔsi fa, n bara tagan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">Ala, i bara n ma denbaya birin halaki.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />I bara n fate birin ba n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">na bara findi seede ra n xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Ala xa xɔnɛ bara dutun n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">a bara n tɔɔrɔ a ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">alɔ n yaxui nɔma a rabade ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />N yaxuie fe ɲaaxi falama n ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">e n nayaagima, e n bɔnbɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">E birin e malanma n xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Ala mu n natanga fonike karinxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">a n so mixi ɲaaxie yi ra.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />N nu bɔɲɛsa nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kɔnɔ a naxa n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">a n imaxa, a n xun nakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">N bara lu alɔ se a luma naxan bɔnbɔ ra.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />A xa tanbɛe n nabilinxi yire birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">e bara n bɔɲɛ sɔxɔ kinikinitareɲa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">e n furingɛe ramini kɛnɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />A n gerema alɔ geresoe xaaɲɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />N bara sunnun donma ragoro n fate ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">n bara n xun sin bɔxi ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Wa bara n yae gbeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">saya bara makɔrɛ n na.<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Kɔnɔ n mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">N nu Ala maxandima sɛniyɛnyi nan kui.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Bɛndɛ, i naxa dusu n wuli xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">a lu n wa xui xa makɛnɛn yire birin.»<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />«Kelife yakɔsi ma fa, n ma seede na koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">n xunmafalama na yire itexi.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />N booree na yofe n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">kɔnɔ n nan n mawama Ala nan bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />N seede xa n xun mafala Ala xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">alɔ mixi a boore xun mafalama ki naxɛ,<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />a xa n xun mafala barima a gbe mu luxi n xa siga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">n mu gbilenma sigɛ naxan kui.»<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi suuli nde dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«N xaxili tixi gaburi nan na»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />«N na n nii magagafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">a gbe mu luxi n ma simaya ra, gaburi a dɛ rabixi n ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Mixie na yofe n ma, n mu nɔma xide.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Ala, yandi, taani n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">mixi gbɛtɛ yo mu tinma na rabade,<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />barima i bara n booree xaxili balan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">I naxa a lu e xa nɔ n na.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />E luma alɔ xɛmɛ naxan donse fima mixi gbɛtɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">a xa di kaamɛxi ya xɔri.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Mixi birin n mayelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">e e dɛ ye bɔxunma n yatagi.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />N ya mu fa sese toma maraɲaaxui xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">n fate birin bara ba n ma.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Tinxintɔɛe kaabama n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">e fa xɔnɔ tinxintaree ma.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Tinxintɔɛ luma a xa kira xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">sɛniyɛntɔɛ sɛnbɛ xun masama.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Wo tan birin nɔma fade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">kɔnɔ n mu laxi a ra xa n lɔnnila keren toma wo ya ma.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />N ma simaya kɔnti bara ɲɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">n mu gɛxi n ma walie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">n waxɔnfe mu sɔɔnɛyaxi n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Yi tinxintaree fe mafindima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">a falafe ra a dimi nan na naiyalanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">E naxɛ a naiyalanyi bara makɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">kɔnɔ e na falama dimi nan kui.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />N xaxili tixi aligiyama nan na fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">n xa sa bɛlɛ dimi kui,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />gaburi xa findi n baba ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">kuli xa findi nga nun n maaginɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />N xaxili tixi munse ra sɔnɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">N xaxili tide yo mu na fa.<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />N xaxili tide na aligiyama nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">n goroma dɛnnaxɛ bɛndɛ xɔɔra.»<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bilidada Suuxaka xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Mixi ɲaaxie xa xunnakanɛ»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Bilidada Suuxaka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />«Wo yi masenyi mɔɔli danma tɛmui mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">Wo xa xaxili sɔtɔ alako won xa wɔyɛn a fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Wo muxu maɲɔxunxi subee ra munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">Munfe ra muxu findixi wo bɛ xaxilitare ra?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Ayuba, i tan naxan xɔnɔxi, duniɲa xa dan i xa fe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Geya xa tala i bɛ a tide?»<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />«N xa a fala wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">mixi ɲaaxi xa fe ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">alɔ tɛ xubenma ki naxɛ, a ba naiyalanyi raminife.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />A xa denbaya xa fe ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">a yɛtɛ xa fe danma nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />A mu a ɲɛrɛma sɛnbɛ ra sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">a waxɔnfe fama nɛ a xun nakanade.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />A bara suxu yɛlɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">a mu minima naxan kui sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Gantanyi bara a sanyi suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">a mu a bama naxan yi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Gantanyi luuti nu nɔxunxi bɛndɛ bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">gantanyi nu texi sankira xɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Gaaxui bara a suxu a xa fe birin kui.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Kaamɛ bara a suxu, a bara lu tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />A fate bara ba a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">a salonse na bɔrɔfe saya kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />A bara keli a xɔnyi a nu laxi dɛnnaxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">a na sigafe mangɛ magaaxuxi yire.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />I nɔma lude a xa banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">a gbe mu luxi sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">Aligiyama bara findi a xɔnyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />A sankee bara xara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">a salonyie bara lisi.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Duniɲa mixie bara nɛɛmu a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">e mu ratuma a xili ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />A bara keli naiyalanyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">a so dimi kui duniɲa fari ma.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Di mu a bɛ, i fa a i nɛ mamadi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">A nu sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">bɔnsɔɛ yo mu a bɛ mɛnni sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Bɔnsɔɛ naxee sa fama, keli sogetede nun sogegorode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">nee fama nɛ kaabade a xa xunnakanɛ ma, gaaxui fa e suxu.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Tinxintare xa maraɲɔnyi luma na ki nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">Ala kolontare xa fe rabama na ki nɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi senni nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«N nakisima na fafe»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />«Wo fama n tɔɔrɔde han tɛmui mundun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">Wo n bɔɲɛ halakima wo xa masenyi ra han tɛmui mundun?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />A dɔxɔ fu nan yi ki wo n konbima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">n tɔɔrɔfe mu wo yaagima?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Xa nɔndi na a ra, n na yunubi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">awa, na yunubi luma n tan nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Xa wo wama a masenfe n bɛ a wo fisa n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">xa wo wama n ma tɔɔrɛ findife n ma yunubi ra,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />wo xa a kolon xɔnɛ naxan na n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">na fatanxi Ala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">a tan nan n suxuxi a xa yɛlɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Xa n sa gbelegbele n ma xɔnɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">n mu yaabi yo sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">Xa n sa wa kiiti xa sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">kiiti tinxinxi yo mu sama.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Ala bara kira ibolon n ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">n mu nɔma dangide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">a bara n ma kira ifɔɔrɔ n ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />A bara n xun nakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">a bara binyɛ birin ba n ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />A bara n ma fe birin nabira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">A bara n xaxili tide tala alɔ sansi bili talama ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />A bara xɔnɔ n ma a ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">n bara findi a yaxui ra.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />A xa geresoe bara n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">e na n gerefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">n mu nɔma n gide e ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />A bara n ngaxakerenyie makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">n kolonmae bara yensen yɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />N dɔxɔbooree bara n nabɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">n dɛfanbooree bara n nabolo.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />N ma xɔɲɛe nun n ma konyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">nee mu n kolon sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />N na n ma konyi xili, hali n a mayandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">a mu n ma xili ratinma.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />N dɛ xiri bara raɲaaxu n ma ginɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">n ma fe mu rafan n ngaxakerenyie ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Dimɛe yati yoma n ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />N gundo xiri boore bara n xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">n xanuntenyie bara n yanfa.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />N fate birin bara ba n ma, n xɔrie mini kɛnɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">Sese mu luxi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />N booree, wo kinikini n ma, yandi, wo kinikini n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">barima Ala nan n bɔnbɔxi.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Munfe ra wo n tɔɔrɔma alɔ Ala a rabaxi ki naxɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Wo mu nu wasa sinden?»<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />«Xa n ma wɔyɛnyie sɛbɛxi buki kui nu,<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />xa e masolixi gɛmɛ ma wure ra nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">na tɛmui e buma nɛ nu abadan.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Kɔnɔ n tan a kolon n nakisima ɲiɲɛ na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">A fama wɔyɛnyi dɔnxɔɛ falade duniɲa ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />N fate na gɛ bɔrɔde, n tan yati fama nɛ Ala tode.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />N tan nan yati fama a tode n yae ra, a mu mataalima n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Na kui n bɔɲɛ sɛɛwama nɛ a fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Wo tan naxee maxɔrinyi tima, ‹Won a tɔɔrɔfe munfe ra?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">Wo fama n ma nɔndi kolonde.<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Wo xa gaaxu santidɛgɛma ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">barima ɲaxankatɛ wo sɔtɔma nɛ wo xa fe ɲaaxie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">Na kui wo fama a kolonde a kiitisa nde na.»<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Sofara xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Tɔɔrɛ nan na tinxintare kɛ ra»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Sofara Naamaka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />«I xa masenyi bara n tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">fo n xa i yaabi.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />N bara marakɔrɔsi nde mɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">naxan bara n xaxili ifu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">N i yaabima n ma lɔnni ra na nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />I mu a kolon kabi adama naxa daa, a lu duniɲa ma,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />mixi ɲaaxie xa xunnakeli mu buma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">E xa ɲɛlɛxinyi dunke?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Hali a xa fe gbo yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">hali a xunyi koore li,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />a fama sɔntɔde a lu alɔ se naxan tide mu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">a kolonmae nu fa maxɔrinyi ti, ‹A na minden?›<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />A dangima nɛ alɔ xiye.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />A kolonmae mu a toma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">a lɔɛma nɛ a xa mixie ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />A xa die setaree kima see ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">e baba naxee muɲa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">E baba xa naafuli gbilenma nɛ na mixie ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Sɛnbɛ naxan nu na a yi ra a fonike ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">na birin kanama nɛ, a findi bɛndɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Fe ɲaaxi na rafan mixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">a fa na ragata a furi kui,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />a mu a bɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">a mu gbilen na fɔxɔ ra,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />a xa donse findima pɔsɔnɛ nan na a furi kui.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />A naafuli naxan donxi, a fama na bɔxunde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Ala yati na bama nɛ a furi kui.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />A bɔximase xa xɔnɛ nan bɛsuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">biida nan a faxama.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />A harige naxan sɔtɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">naxan bara gbo yɛ alɔ xure,<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />a na birin nagbilenma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">a mu nɔma na sese donde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">Na mu findima ɲɛlɛxinyi ra a bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />barima a bara se ba tɔɔrɔmixie yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">A bara e xa banxie ba e yi ra, a mu naxee tixi.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Wasabali nan to nu a ra a xa milɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">a harige keren mu ratangama.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />A to nu se birin maɲɔxunxi a yɛtɛ nan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">a xa hɛɛri mu buma.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />A nɛ na a xa fanyi tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">tɔɔrɔ sin tɛmui nan na ki a ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />A dɛge tɛmui, Ala fama a tɔɔrɔde a xa xɔnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">na tɔɔrɛ fa findi a xa donse ra.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Xa geresose lanmadi mu a tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">geresose xungbe nan nawalima a xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Hali a tanbɛ tala e a sɔxɔxi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">fe magaaxuxi gbɛtɛ fama nɛ a lide.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />A xa naafuli birin luma dimi nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">tɛ fa na birin gan a xɔnyi.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Ala a xa yunubi makɛnɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">adamadie na sare ragbilen a ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />A xa naafuli birin sigama nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">Ala xa xɔnɛ lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Ala na nan fima mixi ɲaaxi ma kɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">Na bara findi Ala ɲanige ra na mixi mɔɔli bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayuba xa masenyi solofere nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Munfe ra tinxintaree mu tɔɔrɔma?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />«Wo wo tuli mati n ma masenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">Wo xa na raba n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Wo diɲɛ n bɛ, n xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">N na gɛ, wo fa yo n ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />N nan n xun mawaxi mixi nan xili ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Fɔlɔ yi tɛmui ma, n diɲɛma munfe ra fa?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Wo wo ya ti n na, wo xa n fate igbɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">Wo mu kaabaxi xɛ n fate ma?<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />N nan n maɲɔxun a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">gaaxui nan n suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">n fate birin nu sɛrɛn n ma.»<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />«Munfe ra mixi ɲaaxie buma duniɲa ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">Munfe ra e findima xɛmɔxi sɛnbɛmae ra?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />E xa die xun nakelima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">e bɔnsɔɛe fan fe fanyi sɔtɔma e ya ɲiɲɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />E xa denbayae luma bɔɲɛsa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">gaaxui yo mu e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">Ala fan mu e tɔɔrɔma.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />E xa tuurae sɛnbɛ gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">e tema e xa ninge ginɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">nee die barima, e furi mu birama.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Na mixi ɲaaxie xa die fare boronma,<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />e sigi sama maxasee, kɔra, nun xule xui ra.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />E xa simaya kamalima hɛɛri kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">e man fa faxa faxɛ sɔɔnɛyaxi ra.»<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />«A nun, e nu a falama nɛ Ala bɛ e xa simaya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">‹I makuya muxu ra, muxu mu wama i xa sɛriyɛ kolonfe.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Muxu Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi rabatuma munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">A maxandife findima geeni mundun na muxu bɛ?›<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />N a kolon e harige mu nu fatanxi e yɛtɛ xa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">n nan n makuyama mixi ɲaaxie xa marasi ra na nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Kɔnɔ halaki mixi ɲaaxie lima tɛmui birin nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Ala gbaloe gbegbe ragirima e ma a xa xɔnɛ kui?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />E xa fe kanama a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">alɔ maale lagi foye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">naxan na fanafananma?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Ala ɲaxankatɛ ragatama e xa die bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Munfe ra a mu e tan yati ɲaxankatama?<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />A lanma e tan yati xa e xa tɔɔrɛ to e ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">e tan yati xa Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi xa xɔnɛ kolon.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Xa mixi ɲaaxi gɛ faxade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">a mu a xa denbaya xa tɔɔrɛ kolonma.<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Adamadi nɔma lɔnni nde fide Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">mangɛya birin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">naxan ma yaamari bun ma?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Mixi nde faxama bɔɲɛsa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">a sɛnbɛ gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">kɔntɔfili yo mu lu a ma,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />a fate fan, a xɔrie xɔrɔxɔ gben.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Kɔnɔ mixi gbɛtɛ tan faxama tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">a mu hɛɛri yo nɛmunnɛmun.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Na mixi firinyi birin sama bɛndɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">kuli fa e don.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />N wo xa maɲɔxunyie kolon a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">wo wama nɔndi rakanafe n na naxee xafe ra.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Wo naxɛ, ‹Kuntigi xa banxi na minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Mixi ɲaaxi xɔnyi na di?›<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Kɔnɔ wo mu maxɔrinyi tixi biyaasilae ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">Wo mu wo tuli matixi e xa dɛntɛgɛ ra?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Mixi ɲaaxi mu gbaloe sɔtɔma gbaloe lɔxɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">a ratangama nɛ na xɔnɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Nde tima a ya i a a makiiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">Nde a xa wali kobi sare ragbilenma a ma?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Mixie a xaninma gaburi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">e man fa binyɛ sa a ma mɛnni.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Gaburi bɛndɛ mu a tɔɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">a binyɛ sɔtɔ ɲama gbegbe ra.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Na kui, wo n madunduma madundui fuyan na di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">Madaxui masenyie nan tun na wo xa lɔnni masenyie kui.»<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Elifasi Temanka xa masenyi saxan nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba xa gbilen Ala ma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Elifasi Temanka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />«Adama tide na Ala bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Ade, adama lɔnnixi nɔma a yɛtɛ gbansan nan malide.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />I xa tinxinyi findima geeni mundun na Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">I lufe nɔndi kui, na Ala malima di?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Ala na i ɲaxankatafe i xa tinxinyi nan xa fe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">A na kiiti ɲaaxi safe i ma na nan ma?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />I xa fe ɲaaxi mu gboxi xɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">I xa yunubie mu wuyaxi xɛ han a dangi a i?<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />I bara see rasuxu sɛɛkɛ ra i ngaxakerenyie yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">I bara e xa sosee yati ba e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">i e mageli ti.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />I mu nu mixi kima ye ra, ye xɔli nu naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">i mu nu kaamɛtɔɛ kima donse ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />I nu bɔxi soma sɛnbɛma nan yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">naa findi yɛtɛ igboe sabatide ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />I nu kaaɲɛ ginɛe nun kiridie keri nɛ e bɛlɛxɛ igeli ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Na nan a toxi i rabilinxi gantanyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">fe magaaxuxie i sɔtɔxi.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />I mu na dimi ɲaaxi tofe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">I mu na ye tofe i madulafe naxan xɔɔra?»<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />«Ala mu na koore ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Tunbuie mato, e itexi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />I fa a falama munfe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">‹Ala munse kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Ala naxan na nuxuie fari ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">na nɔma kiiti sade be?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Nuxuie na Ala nun adamae nan tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">Ala a ɲɛrɛma koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">kɔnɔ a mu nɔma adamae tode.›<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />I wama lufe na kira fori nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">tinxintaree na dɛnnaxɛ kabi tɛmui xɔnnakuye?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />E faxa nɛ e xa simaya kɔnti mu kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">alɔ ye banbaranxi se xaninma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />E a fala nɛ Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">‹Gbilen muxu fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nɔma munse rabade muxu bɛ?›<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Kɔnɔ Ala nan harige gbegbe fi e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">Na nan a toma n mu n tuli matima mixi ɲaaxie xa marasi ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Tinxintɔɛe mixi ɲaaxie xa halaki toma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">a findi e bɛ ɲɛlɛxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">Mixi fanyie yoma nɛ e ma, e a fala,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‹Muxu yaxuie bara sɔntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">tɛ bara e xa naafuli gan.›<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Na kui, i tan xa i xa fe yailan i tan nun Ala tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">alako i xa bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔ, i man xa hɛɛri kolon.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />I xa tin a xa marasi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">i xa a xa masenyi masɔtɔ i bɔɲɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Xa i man gbilenma Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">a fama i xun nakelide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">I xa fe ɲaaxi makuya i xɔnyi ra,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />i xa xɛɛma woli xure ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">na xɛɛma naxan kelixi Ofiri bɔxi ma.<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Na tɛmui Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nan findima i harige ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">a findi i xa xɛɛma nun gbeti ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nan fama rafande i ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">dangife fe birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">I fama i xaxili tide a tan nan na.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />I na a maxandi, a i xa dubɛ suxuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">Na tɛmui i xa i gbe laayidi rakamali a mabiri.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />A i xa natɛe sɔɔnɛyama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">a tɛ yanbama i bɛ i xa kirae birin xɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Ala a niyama nɛ i xa mixi magoroxi rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">barima a luma na mixi mɔɔli mali ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />A nɔma yunubitɔɛ yati rakiside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">i xa sɛniyɛnyi saabui ra.»<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi solomasaxan nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala na minden?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />«To fan n ma yaxaseri masa xɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">a xa kote gbo n xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">n sɛnbɛ bara ɲɔn.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Xa a sa li n nu nɔma Ala tode nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">xa a sa li n nu nɔma sigade a xɔnyi nu,<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />n nan n xaxili kui ifee birin falama nɛ a bɛ nu.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Na kui n nu nɔma nɛ a xa yaabi kolonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">alako n xa fahaamui sɔtɔ na kui.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />A fama a sɛnbɛ birin naminide n ma kiitife ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Ade, a a yae nan tima n na tun.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Na tɛmui a n ma tinxinyi toma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">a fa nɔndi fi n ma.»<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />«Kɔnɔ Ala mu toma sogetede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">a mu toma sogegorode.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />N a fenma kɔɔla ma, n a fenma yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">kɔnɔ a mu toma.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Kɔnɔ a tan n toma a fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">A na gɛ n tode, a nɔndi fima n ma.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />N biraxi nɛ a fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">n a xa sɛriyɛ birin nabatu.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />N mu a xa yaamarie bɛɲinxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">A waxɔnfe findixi nɛ n waxɔnfe ra.»<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />«Nde nɔma a xa natɛ tongoxi masarade?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">A wama naxan xɔn, a na nan nabama.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />A naxan ɲanigexi n ma fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">a fama na nan nagiride n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">A fama fe gbɛtɛe fan sade na fari.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Na nan a toma n gaaxuma a ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">N na a xa fe maɲɔxun, n mu suusama.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Ala bara limaniya ba n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi bara n magaaxu,<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />kɔnɔ n mu dunduma na dimi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">na dimi mu nɔma n na.»<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi solomasaxan nde dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala kiiti sama tɛmui mundun?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />«Munfe ra Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi mu lɔxɔɛ ragataxi kiiti safe ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">Munfe ra a xa mixie mu na lɔxɔɛ kolonxi?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Mixie naaninyie tɔnxuma masigama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">e xurusee muɲama, e e ragbɛngbɛn yire gbɛtɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Kiridie xa sofale muɲama e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">kaaɲɛ ginɛ xa ninge rasuxuma a yi ra sɛɛkɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />E setaree xa kira balanma e ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">e tɔɔrɔmixie karaxanma e xa e nɔxun.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Tɔɔrɔmixie minima subaxɛ ma baloe fende e xa die bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">e walima alɔ sofale gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">e mu donse yo sɔtɔma.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />E xɛ xabama tinxintaree bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">e e xa sansi bogie bama e bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />E kɔɛ radangima xinbeli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">dugi yo mu e yi ra e naxan felenma e ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Tunɛ e bundama naxan kelima geyae kɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">bage to mu e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">e e xide fenma gɛmɛe longori ra.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Kiridi nga xiɲɛe bama e dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">sɛɛkɛ rasuxuma setaree yi ra.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Nee mageli nan sigama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">E kote xaninma kaamɛ ra e ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />E sansi xɔrie wuruma, e ture ba a i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">e wɛni bogi boronma, e wɛni ba a i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">E na birin nabama ye xɔli ra e ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Mixie e mawama taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">Mixi maxɔnɔxie xili tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">kɔnɔ Ala gbe fe yo mu na na fee.»<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />«Mixi ɲaaxie, nee mu naiyalanyi kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">e mu na kirae kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">e mu e ɲɛrɛma nee xɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Faxɛti kelima subaxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">a tɔɔrɔmixi nun setare faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">a muɲɛ ti kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Kuye na ifɔɔrɔ, yɛnɛla a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">‹Mixi yo mu n toma,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">a fa mini dugi dusuxi a yatagi xun na.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Kɔɛ ra muɲɛtie naadɛe kanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">yanyi ra e e yɛtɛ mabalan banxie kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">Naiyalanyi mu rafan e ma hali.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />E tan, kɔɛ findixi e bɛ e xa yanyi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">dimi nan e malima.»<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />«Banbaranyi fama tinxintare xaninde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">a dankaxi nan a ra duniɲa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">A mu wɛni bilie toma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Aligiyama yunubitɔɛ xa fe danma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">alɔ soge linlinyi balabalanyi ye xɔrima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Ginɛ naxan xiɲɛ fixi yunubitɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">na nɛɛmuma nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">kulie tan fa a don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">Mixi yo mu ratuma a ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">Na kui a xa tinxintareya bara tala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">alɔ sansi talama ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />A fe ɲaaxi rabama ginɛ dibaritare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">a mu kinikinima kaaɲɛ ginɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Kɔnɔ Ala naxan fata na tuurae suxude sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">e nii raɲaaxu e ma,<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />a nee luma e xa bɔɲɛsa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">a fa bira mixi gbɛtɛe tan ma fe fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Mixi minima waxati nde nan nabade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">kɔnɔ na waxati na kamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">a xa fe xuben a ɲɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">Adamadi luxi nɛ alɔ maale na mɔ xɛ xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">maale xabee fa a xaba.»<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />«Nde nɔma n ma masenyi matandide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">Nde nɔma a falade nɔndi mu a ra?»<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Bilidada Suuxaka xa masenyi saxan nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Mangɛya na Ala nan yi»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Bilidada Suuxaka naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />«Mangɛya na Ala nan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">fo won xa gaaxu a ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">A tan nan bɔɲɛsa ragirima koore ma.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />A xa gali kɔnti nɔma kolonde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Nde na a xa soge yanbɛ mu naxan lima?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Adama tinxinma di Ala ya i?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Ginɛ bari di sɛniyɛnma di?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Xa kike xa yanbɛ yɛtɛ yati mu gbo Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">xa tunbuie mu sɛniyɛn a ya i,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />adamadi go,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">naxan xurun alɔ kuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">naxan findixi kuli yɔrɛ di gbansan na?»<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi solomanaani nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Nde nɔma Ala sɛnbɛ fahaamude?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ayuba naxa a yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />«I fata sɛnbɛtare malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">I fata mixi ralimaniyade.<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />I fata lɔnnitare raside.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">I xaxili fanyi masenma,<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />kɔnɔ i na masenma nde bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Nde na xaxili fixi i ma?»<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />«Mixi faxaxie sɛrɛnma baa nun bɔxi bun ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Aligiyama naadɛ rabixi Ala ya tode ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">a naa igbɛxi.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Ala nan koore daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">a a singan kuye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">a bɔxi singan a yɛtɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />A tunɛ ye ragatama nuxuie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">ye xa binyɛ man mu nɔ e bɔɔde.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />A a xa kibanyi ya makotoxi nuxuie nan na.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />A naaninyi saxi naiyalanyi nun dimi tagi.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Koore sɛrɛnma, a kaabama Ala xaaɲɛ xui mɛfe ra.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />A sɛnbɛ baa imaxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">a baa yɛxɛe magaaxuxi ibɔɔma a xaxili fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />A kɛrɛ foye koore rasɛniyɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">a bɛlɛxɛ bɔximase gixi sɔxɔma.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Xa yee findixi a xa wali xurie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">won mu nɔma naxee fahaamude a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">nde nɔma a sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi tan fahaamude?»<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi solomanaani nde dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Fo n xa nɔndi fala»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ayuba man naxa masenyi ti:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />«N bara n kali Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">naxan mu nɔndi fima n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">naxan bara n nafe xɔnɛ ra,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />danmi n ɲɛngima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">danmi n ɲɛngi naxan fatanxi Ala ra na nan n fate i,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />tinxintareya mu minima n dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">N mu wule falama.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Han n faxa, n mu nɔndi fima wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">n mu n yɛtɛ tɔɔɲɛgɛma.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />N tan a kolon n tinxin, sese man mu n bama mɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">N mu n ma fe ɲaaxi yo kolon.»<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />«N yaxui xa suxu alɔ mixi ɲaaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">n gerefa xa suxu alɔ tinxintare.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Ala na natɛ tongo a xa na mixi mɔɔlie faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">xaxili tide yo mu luma e bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Ala nee maxandi xui tongoma e tɔɔrɔ tɛmui?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Ala rafan na mixi mɔɔli ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">A Ala maxandima tɛmui birin?»<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />«N xa Ala sɛnbɛ masen wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">n mu Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi waxɔnfe nɔxunma wo ma.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Wo birin bara yi to a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">wo fa wɔyɛnyi fufafu falama munfe ra?»<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />«Ala naxan nagirima mixi ɲaaxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi naxan soma a yi ra kɛ ra, na nan yi ki:<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />A xa die na wuya, e faxama santidɛgɛma nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">a xa mamadie faxa kaamɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />A xa mixi ndee na lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">nee fa faxa a xanbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">e xa kaaɲɛ ginɛe mu wama e xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />A xa naafuli na gbo yɛ alɔ mɛyɛnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">a xa dugi na wuya alɔ bɛndɛ gbegbe malanxi,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />a tan nan na malanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">kɔnɔ tinxintɔɛ nan na dugi ragoroma a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">sɛniyɛntɔɛ nan na naafuli sɔtɔma.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />A xa banxi luma alɔ turunturunyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">alɔ xɔni keri xa bage di.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />A bannaxi nan a sama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">kɔnɔ a ragatama a tɔɔrɔxi nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">A na a ya rabi, sese mu na a yi ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Gaaxui a suxuma tɛrɛnna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">alɔ banbaranyi, alɔ turunnaadɛ kɔɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Foye xungbe a xaninma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">a a tala a sabatide.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Tanbɛe wolima a ma, a mu bama a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">fo a xa a gi nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Mixie ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ a xa xunnakanɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">e yo a ma.»<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi solomanaani nde dɛ idɔxɔɛ man</para>
  <para style="s2">«Lɔnni na minden?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />«Yire na na gbeti bama bɔxi ma dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">xɛɛma raxunude fan na na.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Yire na na wure bama bɔxi ma dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">gɛmɛ raxunuxi fan wure gbeeli raminima.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Mixi yili gema bɔxi bun dimi kui na see fenfe ra.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />E yili gema wula i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">dɛnnaxɛ makuya mixi sabatide ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">Mɛnni mixi goroma luuti ma bɔxi bun ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Baloe minima bɔxi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">kɔnɔ a bunyi tan luma alɔ tɛ nan yiriyirima.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Mɛnni e gɛmɛ tofanyie toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">e xɛɛma fuɲi raminima.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Xɔni xaaɲɛ mu mɛnni kira kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">sɛgɛ mu mɛnni toma.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Sube magaaxuxi mu e ɲɛrɛma mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">yɛtɛ mu dangima naa.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Kɔnɔ adama tan gɛmɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ gema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">han a geya bunyi li.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />A yili gema gɛmɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">alako a xa naafuli to.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />A ye kira balanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">a tɛ xaninma naa alako a xa se nɔxunxi to.»<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />«Kɔnɔ lɔnni tan toma minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Xaxili fanyi lude na minden na?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Adama mu lɔnni tide kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">Lɔnni mu toma duniɲa mixi baloxie tagi.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />A mu toma dabonyi xungbe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">a mu toma baa ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />A mu sarama xɛɛma ra, a mu sɔtɔma gbeti ra.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />A mu sama sikeeli ma xɛɛma sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">xa na mu a ra gɛmɛ tofanyie sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />A maniyɛ mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">A maniyɛ mu findi xɛɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">a mu findi gɛmɛ tinsexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">a mu findi xɛɛma pɔɔti tofanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Lɔnni tide gbo diyaman bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">a sɔtɔfe tide gbo gɛmɛ tofanyi bɛ naxan toma baa ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Lɔnni maniyɛ mu findi gɛmɛ tofanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">naxan kelixi yire makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">A mu maniyama sikeeli ra alɔ xɛɛma.»<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />«Na kui, lɔnni kelixi minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Xaxili fanyi lude na minden na?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />A nɔxunxi nimasee ma naxee na bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">a nɔxunxi xɔnie ma naxee na koore ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Aligiyama bara a xa fe nde mɛ, kɔnɔ a mu a kolon.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Ala nan lɔnni kira kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">a tan nan a lingira toma,<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />barima a tan nan duniɲa nun koore igbɛma han e dande.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />A to gɛ foye nun ye itaxunde,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />a to gɛ tunɛ, seyamakɔnyi, nun galanyi yamaride,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />awa, a naxa lɔnni ramini, a a mato a fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Na kui a naxa a fala adamadie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">Ala xa yaragaaxui findixi lɔnni nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">fe ɲaaxi bɛɲinfe findixi xaxili fanyi nan na.»<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«N ma tɛmui fanyi dangixi»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Ayuba naxa yi masenyi ti:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />«Xa n ma tɛmui dangixie nan a ra yi ki nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">Ala nu mɛɛnima n ma tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />A xa naiyalanyi to nu na n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">a to nu tɛ tima n bɛ kira xɔn ma dimi kui.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />N sɛnbɛ nu gbo na tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">n nun Ala dɛ nu fan.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Na tɛmui Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nu na n sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">n ma die fan nu na n nabilinyi.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />N ma fe birin nu sɔɔnɛyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">xiɲɛ nun ture nu gbo n yi ra.»<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />«N to nu sigama taa sode dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">ɲama nu na dɛnnaxɛ,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />fonikee nu kira ibama nɛ n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">forie nu keli e ti n binyafe ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Kuntigie nu e sabarima nɛ n ya ra,<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />mangɛe nu wɔyɛnyi so n yi, e tan dundu,<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />barima naxan na n xui mɛ, a fe fanyi fala n ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">Naxee nu n toma, n nu rafanma e ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />N nu tɔɔrɔmixie malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">n nu kiridie kima, booree nu nɛɛmuma naxee ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Mixi naxan nu na saya kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">na nu dubama nɛ n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">N nu kaaɲɛ ginɛ bɔɲɛ rasɛɛwama.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />N nu n ɲɛrɛma tinxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">nɔndi nu findixi n yuge nan na.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />N nu findixi saabui fanyi nan na dɔnxui nun mabɛnyi bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />N nu findixi babɛ nan na setaree bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">n xɔɲɛe mali e xa tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />N nu tinxintaree xa fe xun nakanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">n misikiinɛ ratanga e xa fe kobie ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />N nu a maɲɔxunma saya n lima hɛɛri nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">n ma simaya fa kamali alɔ baa dɛ ra mɛyɛnyi.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />N nu a maɲɔxunma n ma duniɲɛigiri sɔɔnɛyama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">alɔ sansi naxan sanke bara ye li, a salonyi xini sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />N nu a maɲɔxunma n xun nakelima nɛ tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">n tanbɛ woli sɛnbɛ ra.»<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />«Mixie nu e tuli matima nɛ n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">e e sabari n ma marasi ramɛfe ra.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />N ma masenyie nu rafanma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">e mu nu e matandima.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />E nu n mamɛma alɔ mixi tunɛ mamɛma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">e n ma wɔyɛnyi birin suxu sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />E na n yatagi to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">e birin nu e xaxili tima n na.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />N nu e raɲɛrɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">n nu luxi nɛ e bɛ alɔ e xa mangɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">naxan dɔxɔxi kibanyi kui e tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">a nu tɔɔrɔmixie madundu.»<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba xa sɛɛwɛ bara findi sunnunyi ra»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />«Kɔnɔ yakɔsi tan, fonikee n mayelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">naxee babae nu findixi n bɛ fuyantee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">n nu yoma naxee ma.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />E yusi mu nu na n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">barima sɛnbɛ yo mu nu e bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Kaamɛtɔɛ nan nu e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">naxee nu sigama gbengberen yire baloe fende.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />E nu ɲoogee matalama fɔtɔnyie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">wuri sankee gbansan nan nu findima e xa donyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Mixie nu e kerima ɲama ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">alɔ muɲɛti kerima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />E nu yigiyama gɛmɛ longorie nan na geyae kɔn na,<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />xa na mu a ra kunsie bun ma.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Fuyantee nan nu e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">naxee nu bara keri bɔxi kui.»<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />«Kɔnɔ yakɔsi fa, nee nan n mayelema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">e xa sigie nun e xa masenyie ra yi ki.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />N ma fe mu rafan e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">E dɛ ye bɔxunma n yatagi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">e nu fa e makuya n na.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Kabi Ala n nabolo n ma tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">e xa mayele mu ɲɔnma.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Yi mixi ya maɲɔxunxie kelima n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">e nu gantanyi ɲaaxie te n bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />E n ma kira ibolonma n ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />E luma alɔ sɔɔri ɲaaxie, naxee soma taa kui tɛtɛ yale ra.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Gaaxui bara n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">n ma fe xun bara rakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">n ma kisi bara dangi n na alɔ nuxui dangima ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />«Yakɔsi, a gbe mu luxi n ma simaya xa ɲɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">n ma tɔɔrɛ bara kamali.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />N ma tɔɔrɛ bara gbo yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">n mu xima kɔɛ ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />A luma alɔ dugi nde nan xirixi n kɔnyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">a xa n faxa.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Ala bara n nagoro han</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">n bara lu alɔ boora, xa na mu a ra tɛ xube.»<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />«Ala, n bara i xili, kɔnɔ i mu a ratinxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">N bara ti i ya i, alako i xa n to.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />I bara tɔɔrɛ ɲaaxi dɔxɔ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">i sɛnbɛ bara nɔ n na.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />A luxi alɔ turunnaadɛ bara n nate koore ma.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />N a kolon i na n xaninfe aligiyama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">duniɲa mixi birin sigama dɛnnaxɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />«Kɔnɔ mixi naxan na saya kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">na mu Ala maxandima xɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">Mixi naxan na tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">na mu Ala makulama xɛ?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />N mu n ya ye ramini tɔɔrɔmixi bɛ nu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">N mu kinikini setare ma nu?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />N wa hɛɛri nan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">kɔnɔ ɲaxankatɛ nan n lixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">N wa lufe naiyalanyi nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">kɔnɔ dimi nan dusuxi n xun na.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />N bɔɲɛ na tɔɔrɔfe lɔxɔɛ birin.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />N na dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">naiyalanyi yo mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">N tixi ɲama tagi, n nu fa wa n xui itexi ra.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />N bara lu alɔ wula i baree nun burunyi xɔni ɲaaxie.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />N kiri bara fɔɔrɔ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">n fate birin kui na iganfe.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />N ma kɔra sunnunyi xui tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">n ma xule ɲɔn fe wa xui raminima.»<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="s2">«Yunubi sare nan ya»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />«N natɛ tongo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">n naxa yabu ginɛdimɛdi ra.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Ala munse ɲanigema n bɛ koore ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi kɛ mundun fima n ma kelife ra a ma?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Setareɲa mu ragataxi mixi ɲaaxi xa bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">Ɲaxankatɛ mu tinxintare xa lima?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Ala mu nu n fɔxi birin matoma xɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">A mu nu n ma santongoe birin kɔntima xɛ?»<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />«Xa n bara n ɲɛrɛ wule kui, xa n bara mixi madaxu,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Ala xa n maniya sikeeli tinxinxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">A n ma tinxinyi toma nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Xa n bara kira tinxinxi bɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">xa n bɔɲɛ bara bira n ya waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">xa n bara n manɔxɔ fe ɲaaxi ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />mixi gbɛtɛe xa n ma sansi sixie bogi don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">n ma sansi sixie birin xa matala bɔxi ma.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Xa ginɛ xɔli bara n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">xa n bara bira n dɔxɔboore xa ginɛ fɔxɔ ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />n ma ginɛ xa bande ɲin xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">a tan nun na xa kafu,<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />barima yɛnɛ findixi fe ɲaaxi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">kiitisae naxan makiitima a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Yɛnɛ, tɛ nan a ra naxan sigama ganyi ti ra han yahannama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">a mixi harige birin xun nakana.»<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />«Xa n mu findi mixi tinxinxi ra nu n ma konyie mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">muxu to nu galanbuma,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />n Ala yaabima di nu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">N nan n yɛtɛ xun mafalama di nu?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Ala keren xa mu muxu birin daaxi muxu nga tɛɛgɛ i?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">Ala keren xa mu muxu birin nabaloxi muxu nga xiɲɛ ra?»<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />«Xa n mu setaree ki nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">xa n mu kaaɲɛ ginɛ mali nu,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />xa n keren bara n ma donse don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">n mu kiridi ki,<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />n naxan xuru, n findi a bɛ babɛ ra kabi a yɔrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">naxan nga kaaɲɛ ginɛ bara lu n xɔnyi kabi a tɛɛgɛxi a ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />xa n mu tɔɔrɔmixi ki dugi ra nu,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />na kanyi lu a mu duba n bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">na dugi xa fe ra naxan kelixi n ma yɛxɛɛe xabe ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />xa n bara kiridi nde tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">n to a kolonxi kiitisae nɔndi fima n ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />n bɛlɛxɛ xa bolon n tunki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">n xɔrie xa magira,<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />barima n gaaxu Ala xa ɲaxankatɛ ya ra a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">n mu nɔma sese ra a sɛnbɛ ya i.»<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />«Xa n bara n xaxili ti n ma xɛɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">xa n bara la n ma naafuli ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />xa n bara ɲɛlɛxin n harige xa gboe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">n naxan sɔtɔ n ma duniɲɛigiri kui,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />xa n bara n ya ti soge nun kike xa yanbɛ ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />n fa nee batu n bɔɲɛ kui gundo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">n nan n bɛlɛxɛ sunbu e xa binyɛ bun ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Ala xa n ɲaxankata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">barima na fe mɔɔli mu fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">n bara findi yanfante ra Ala mabiri.»<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />«N bara ɲɛlɛxin n xɔnma xa tɔɔrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">n sɛɛwa a xa ɲaxankatɛ ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />n tan naxan mu nu tinma a dankade n dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">n xa na yunubi mɔɔli raba?<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />N ma xɔɲɛe birin mu nu a falama xɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">‹A n dɛ wasaxi sube ra›?<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />N nu biyaasilae yigiyama nɛ alako e naxa xi tande.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />N bara n ma fe ɲaaxie nɔxun n bɔɲɛ kui alɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">adamadie darixi a ra ki naxɛ? Ade.<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />N bara gaaxu ɲama xa wɔyɛnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">xa na mu a ra n xabilɛ xa wɔyɛnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">n fa lu n xɔnyi nɔxunyi kui n mu nɔndi fala? Ade.»<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />«Xa mixi na naxan tinma a tuli matide n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">n ma masenyi dɔnxɔɛ nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Ala xa n yaabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">A naxan toma n ma, a xa na sɛbɛ,<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />n xa na dɔxɔ n xun ma, n xa a gbaku n kɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />N dɛntɛgɛ sama nɛ a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">alɔ mixi dɛntɛgɛ sama mangɛ bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Xa n ma bɔxi nde bara xɔnɔ n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">xa mixi nde ya ye bara silɔn na,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />xa n bara donse nde don n mu a rawalima sare fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">xa n bara a kanyi tɔɔrɔ,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />mɛngi naxan na n ma bɔxi ma, na xa findi tunbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">n ma fundenyi xa findi ɲooge ɲaaxi ra.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">Ayuba xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ nan na ki.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu xa masenyi singe</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala nan lɔnni fima mixi ma»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Yi xɛmɛ saxanyie naxa ba Ayuba xa wɔyɛnyi yaabife, barima a nu a yɛtɛ findixi nɔndi falɛ nan na. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Na kui Elihu, Barakeeli Buusika xa di, naxan fatan Rama xabilɛ ra, a bɔɲɛ naxa te Ayuba xili ma, barima na nu a yɛtɛ findixi nɔndi falɛ nan na Ala ya i. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />A bɔɲɛ naxa te a boore saxanyie xili ma, barima e mu nu nɔma Ayuba yaabide hali e to a kolonxi nɔndi mu nu a bɛ. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Na mixi saxanyie to nu mɔxi a bɛ, Elihu mamɛ ti na nan ma wɔyɛnfe ra Ayuba bɛ. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Elihu nu bara a to, yaabi yo mu nu na yi mixi saxanyie yi ra fa. Na kui a bɔɲɛ naxa te.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Elihu, Barakeeli Buusika xa di, naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">«Fonike nan n na, forie nan wo tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">N gaaxu n ma marakolonyi sade wo ya i na nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />N naxɛ, ‹Fori nan fata wɔyɛnde, a xa simaya xɔnkuye xa fe ra.›<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Kɔnɔ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi nan xaxili fima adama ma.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Simaya xɔnkuye gbansan xa mu xaxilimaya fima mixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">forie gbansan xa mu findixi nɔndi kanyie ra.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Na kui n bara wo maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">wo xa wo tuli mati n ma marakolonyi ra.»<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />«N bara wo xa masenyi raɲɔnyi mamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">n bara n tuli mati wo xa masenyi birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">wo naxan falaxi Ayuba xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />N bara wo xa masenyie ramɛ, kɔnɔ wo mu nɔxi Ayuba yaabide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">wo mu nɔxi nɔndi makɛnɛnde a bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Wo naxa a fala de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">‹Won tan bara gɛ lɔnni sɔtɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Won xa lu Ala xa yi xɛmɛ rafahaamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">adamadi mu nɔma na rabade.›<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ayuba mu a xa masenyi tixi n tan xa xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">N fan man mu a yaabima wo xa masenyie ra.»<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />«Limaniya bara ba wo yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">Yaabi yo mu na sɔnɔn wo naxan tima.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />N bara wo xa masenyi dande to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">yaabi yo mu minima wo dɛ kui fa.<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Yakɔsi n xa n gbe fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">n tan fan xa n ma lɔnni masen kɔrɛ,<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />barima fe gbegbe na n furi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">N xaxili na n tutunfe,<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />alɔ wɛni nɛɛnɛ naxan xufuxufufe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">a wama a sase bulafe.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />N xa wɔyɛn alako n bɔɲɛ xa goro.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">N dɛ xa yaabi ti.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />N mu mixi yo rafisama a boore bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">n mu taamixiya rabama mixi yo bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />N mu fata taamixiya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">n na na raba, Ala n naboloma nɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu xa masenyi singe dɛ idɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Xunmafalama xa lu Adama bɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />«Yakɔsi Ayuba, i i tuli mati n ma masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">i xa n ma wɔyɛnyi ramɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />N bara n dɛ rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">n nɛnyi bara keli.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />N ma masenyi kelixi n bɔɲɛ fiixɛ nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">nɔndi nan minima n dɛ i.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Ala Xaxili bara n daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">Ala Sɛnbɛ kanyi ɲɛngi bara n findi mixi ɲiɲɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Xa i nɔma n yaabide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">i xa na raba.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Won firin birin lan Ala ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">N fan yailanxi bɛndɛ nan na.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Na kui i naxa gaaxu n ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Kɔnɔ i bara wɔyɛnyi nde fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">n naxan mɛxi n tuli ra.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />I bara a fala, ‹N sɛniyɛn, n mu yunubi rabaxi,<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />kɔnɔ Ala man na fe nde tofe n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">n findixi a yaxui ra naxan ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />A bara n sanyi mabalan yɔlɔnxɔnyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">a nu fa n fɔxi birin igbɛ.›<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Kɔnɔ n xa a fala i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">nɔndi mu i bɛ na fe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">barima Ala gbo mixi bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />I wama Ala rakiitife munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">A mu yaabi fima a xa fe rabaxi birin ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Ala fe masenma won bɛ ki nde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">kɔnɔ won mu won ɲɔxɔ sama na xɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />A nɔma wɔyɛnde xiye ra kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">mixi xima tɛmui naxɛ e xa sade ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />A nɔma adamadie tuli rabide na tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">a e rakolon fee ra naxee kelixi a tan ma,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />alako e xa kira ɲaaxi bɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">a man xa e ratanga e yɛtɛ kan igbofe ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Na kui, a e ratangama nɛ gaburi gbaloe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">a e ratanga santidɛgɛma ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Ala man nɔma masenyi tide adamadi bɛ a xa tɔɔrɛ nde ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">naxan xɔnɛ soma han a xɔrie kui a xa fure dagi tagi.<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />Donse yati fa raɲaaxu a ma, a mu nɔ a dɛgede.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />A fate ba a ma, a xɔrie birin sa kɛnɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />A makɔrɛ aligiyama ra, Sayamalekɛ fa a fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />«Kɔnɔ xa xɛɛra xunmafalama nde sa lu a bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">malekɛ galie ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">naxan fama tinxin ki masende na kanyi bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Na kui, xɛɛra xunmafalama findima saabui fanyi ra a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">Ala hinnɛ a ra, a a masen Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">‹A rakisi faxɛ ma, n bara a xunsare ba.›<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Na kui, a fate man gbilenma dimɛdiɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">a man fonike sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Adamadi na Ala hinnɛnte maxandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">a Ala yatagi toma nɛ sɛɛwɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">Ala fa tinxinyi fi a ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Na kanyi bɛɛti bama nɛ mixie ya i, a a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">‹N yunubi rabaxi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">n tinxinyi madalin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">kɔnɔ na sare mu ragbilenxi n ma a ki ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Ala bara n xɔrɛya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">n tan naxan xun nu tixi aligiyama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">A man bara gbilen naiyalanyi masen na n bɛ.›<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Ala nan na rabama adama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">keren, firin, han saxan,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />alako a xa a ba faxɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">a xa a lu naiyalanyi kui.»<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />«Ayuba, i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">i xa i sabari, i xa n ma masenyi ramɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Xa yaabi nde na i bɛ, i xa na fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">barima n wama nɔndi fife i ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Kɔnɔ xa na mu a ra, i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">i xa i sabari alako i xa xaxili sɔtɔ n na.»<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala xa kiiti tinxin»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Elihu naxa a masen,<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />«Lɔnnilae, wo wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">Xaxilimae, wo n ma masenyi ramɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />barima tuli wɔyɛnyi sensima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">alɔ nɛnyi donse sensima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Won xa tinxinyi sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">won xa bira fe fanyi fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />«Ayuba naxɛ, ‹N tinxin, kɔnɔ Ala mu nɔndi fixi n ma.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Hali n to tinxinxi, a bara n lu alɔ wule falɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">N mu yunubi yo rabaxi, kɔnɔ n na tɔɔrɛ ɲaaxi kui.›<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Nde yaagi sɔtɔxi dangi Ayuba ra?<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />A bara a ɲɛrɛ tinxintareya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">a bara lu fe ɲaaxi rabae ya ma.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />A bara a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">‹Geeni mu na adamadi bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">naxan birama Ala waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra.›<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />Xaxilimae, wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Ala nun fe ɲaaxi tagi ikuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi mu tinxintareya kolon.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />A mixie xa fe rabaxi sare ragbilenma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">a kote dɔxɔma e xun ma e nun naxan lan.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Ala mu nɔma fe ɲaaxi rabade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi mu nɔma tinxinyi kanade.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Nde a ti a xa duniɲa yamari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Nde duniɲa taxuxi a ra?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Xa Ala mu a ɲɛngi saxi adamadie xɔn ma nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">a fa a xaxili nun a ɲɛngi ba e yi,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />adamadi birin faxama kerenyi nan na nu, e findi bɛndɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Xa xaxili fanyi na i yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">i xa i tuli mati n ma masenyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Tinxintare nɔma duniɲa yamaride?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">I Tinxintɔɛ Sɛnbɛma nan kalamuma?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />I nɔma a falade mangɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">‹Mixi xuri di nan i ra?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">I nɔma a falade kuntigie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">‹Wo ɲaaxu?›<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Ala mu mangɛ rafisa mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">a mu bannae rafisa setaree bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">barima a tan nan birin daaxi.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Faxɛ man e birin tɛrɛnnama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">Ɲamae e xunyi ikelima, kɔɛ kui e birin sɔntɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">Sɛnbɛmae yati faxama nɛ fɔyɔgɔntɔn.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Ala adamadie xa kira birin matoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">a e fɔxi igbɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Dimi mu na naxan nɔma tinxintaree nɔxunde.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Ala hayi mu na tɛmui xɔnkuye ma mixi makiitife ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />A nɔma sɛnbɛmae xun nakanade mafurenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">a fa mixi gbɛtɛe dɔxɔ e ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />A na e xa fe ɲaaxi to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">a nɔma e bade duniɲa ma kerenyi ra kɔɛ kui.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />A nɔma e bɔnbɔde alɔ mixi kobi ɲama ya xɔri,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />barima e mɛɛxi a xa sɛriyɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">e a xa kira bɛɲin.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />E bara a niya setare wa xui xa Ala li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">Ala tɔɔrɔmixi malima.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Xa Ala a sabari, nde nɔma a kalamude?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Xa Ala a nɔxun, nde nɔma a tode?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Adamadi mu nɔma na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">ɲamanɛe yati mu nɔma na ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Ala mu tinxintare luma mangɛya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">alako a xa gantanyi te ɲama bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Na mixi mɔɔli mu a falama Ala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">‹N bara gbilen fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra n ma ɲaxankatɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />N fe ɲaaxi naxan nabaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">na masen n bɛ, n mu na rabama sɔnɔn?›<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Ala lanma a xa a sare fi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">I tan nan a matandife, n tan mu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">i tan nan yaabi tima.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Xaxilimae nun lɔnnilae naxee e tuli matixi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">muxu birin bara lan yi ma:<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />Ayuba wɔyɛnfe xaxilitareɲa nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">lɔnni mu a yi.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Ayuba xa ɲaxankata han a dande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">barima a xa masenyie mu tinxin.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />A xa yunubi xun nan tun masafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">A wɔyɛnma muxu bɛ yɛtɛ igboɲa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">A a xa Ala matandi xun masama a xa wɔyɛnyi ra.»<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu xa masenyi saxan nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala i xa fe kolon»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Elihu naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />«I ɲɔxɔ a ma nɔndi na i bɛ i na a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">‹N ma tinxinyi fatanxi Ala nan na?›<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />I bara a maxɔrin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">‹Geeni mundun na n bɛ xa n mu yunubi rabama?›<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />N tan nan i yaabima na ra, i tan nun i booree.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Koore mato. Nuxui mu na i xun ma xɛ?<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Xa i yunubi raba, na findima tɔɔrɛ ra Ala nan bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">Xa i a matandi, na findima kote mundun na a bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Xa i tinxin, na findima geeni mundun na a tan bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />I xa fe ɲaaxi nɔma adamadi nan gbansan tɔɔrɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">adamadi naxan luxi alɔ i tan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">I xa tinxinyi fan nɔma findide geeni ra adamadi nan gbansan bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Mixie e wa xui mɛma barima fe ɲaaxi rabae wuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">Mixie xili tima na kobiɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Kɔnɔ mixi yo mu a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">‹N Daa Mangɛ Ala na minden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">n bɛɛti bama naxan bɛ kɔɛ ra,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />naxan lɔnni fima adamadie ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">dangife subee ra naxee na duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">dangife xɔnie ra naxee na kuye ma?›<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Mixie xili tima, kɔnɔ a mu e yaabima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">fe ɲaaxi rabae xa yɛtɛ igboɲa xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />E xili tima fufafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">barima Ala mu a tuli matima e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi mu e xui ramɛma.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Kɔnɔ i tan nan a falaxi a i mu Ala toxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">i xa fe saxi a ya i, i na a mamɛfe tun.<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />A mu nu xɔnɔ i xa matandi wɔyɛnyie ma sinden.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Ayuba, i bara i dɛ rabi fufafu xaxilitareɲa falafe ra.»<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu xa masenyi naani nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala adama rasima»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu man naxa a fala,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />«I xa mamɛ ti, n fama n ma lɔnni masende i bɛ Ala xa fe kui.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />N ma lɔnni kelima yire makuye nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">N nɔndi fima nɛ n Daa Mangɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Wule yo mu na n ma masenyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">I nun naxan a ra yi ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">tinxintɔɛ nan a ra naxan xa lɔnni kamalixi.»<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />«Ala sɛnbɛ gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">a mu yoma mixi yo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">A sɛnbɛ gbo, a ɲanige fan.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />A mu a luma mixi ɲaaxie xa bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">a mɛɛnima tɔɔrɔmixie ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />A mɛɛnima nɛ tinxintɔɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">a e rasabati mangɛe sɛɛti ma kibanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">a e xa fe ite e xa bu abadan.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Kɔnɔ xa e suxuxi tɔɔrɛ nan kui,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />a e xa fe ɲaaxie masen e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">e naxee rabaxi e xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kui.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />A marasi fanyi fi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">a a fala e bɛ e xa tinxintareya bɛɲin.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Xa e e tuli matima a ra, e na sɛriyɛ rabatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">e xa simaya xɔn kuyama nɛ hɛɛri kui, e xa fe birin sɔɔnɛya.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Kɔnɔ xa e mu e tuli matima a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">e faxama nɛ santidɛgɛma ra lɔnnitareɲa kui.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Tinxintaree xɔnɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">e mu Ala maxandima a na e suxu tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />E faxama e fonike nan na langoee ya ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Kɔnɔ Ala tɔɔrɔmixie rakisima nɛ e xa tɔɔrɛ saabui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">Tɔɔrɛ nan marasi fima e ma.»<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />«A wama i tan fan nakisife i xa tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">alako tɔɔrɛ naxa i raxɛtɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">alako donse fanyi xa lu i yi ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Kɔnɔ i na a raba alɔ mixi ɲaaxie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">ɲaxankatɛ naxan lan a xa dɔxɔ mixi ɲaaxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">na kiiti tinxinxi nan dɔxɔma i fan ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />I naxa yo Ala ma i xa xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">i naxa gbilen Ala fɔxɔ ra se nde xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />I wa xui nɔma i raminide i xa tɔɔrɛ kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">I nɔma na rabade i yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ ra?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Kɔɛ naxa findi i bɛ mixi tɔɔrɔ se ra,<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />i naxa bira fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra i xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Fisamante nan Ala ra a sɛnbɛ xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">Nde nɔma a raside?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Nde nɔma a yamaride?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">Nde nɔma a falade, ‹I bara tantan?›<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />I xa a xa kɛwali matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">alɔ mixie luma a ba ra bɛɛti ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Adamadi birin bara a xa wali to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">duniɲa birin a toma kelife yire makuye.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Ala sɛnbɛ gbo, won mu nɔma na birin kolonde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">Won mu nɔma a xa abadan kɔnti kolonde.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />A ye tonbie mafindima tunɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">a fa a ragoro bɔxi ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Nuxuie nan tunɛ ye rayensenma adamadi birin xun ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Nde nɔma nuxui xa wali fahaamude?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">Nde nɔma galanyi xa fe kolonde?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />A seyamakɔnyi ragoroma baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">a naiyalanyi xungbe ramini.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />A ɲamanɛ makiitima nee nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">A baloe fima e ma a fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />A seyamakɔnyi wolima a waxɔnde.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Galanyi xui mixie rakolonma nɛ tunɛ xa fa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">hali xuruse gɔɔrɛe fan nakolonma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">e nu fa gbata e makɔrɛde e lingira ra.»<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="s1">Elihu xa masenyi suuli nde</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala xa kɛwali sɛnbɛ gbo»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />«N bɔɲɛ sɛrɛnma na nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Wo wo tuli mati Ala xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">na xui gbe naxan minima a kɛrɛ i.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />A xa seyamakɔnyi koore birin nafema nɛ, a duniɲa naaninyi birin li.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Na dangi xanbi galanyi bula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">A luma alɔ Ala wama a xui xungbe xa mɛ yire birin.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Ala xui findixi kaabanakoe nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">A fe xungbe rabama won mu naxan fahaamuma.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />A a falama balabalanyi bɛ, ‹Goro bɔxi ma.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">A tunɛ ye fan nagoro a gbegbe ra.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />A adamadie xa wali birin danma nɛ kerenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">alako e xa a kolon a tan nan na birin nagirima.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Sube xaaɲɛe fan soma e lingira na tɛmui nɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Turunnaadɛ foye kelima a yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">a sa findi foye xinbeli ra kɔɔla ma.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Ala a ɲɛngi foye findima balabalanyi ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">a baa ye fari birin naxɔrɔxɔ gben,<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />a nuxuie raxinbeli, a a xa seyamakɔnyi lu e ma.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />A xa yamari nan na birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">a tan nan nee birin naɲɛrɛma duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">a waxɔnfe rabafe ra.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Na birin luma alɔ luxusinyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">a bɔxi isee xunsinma naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">xa na mu a ra, alɔ fe fanyi a hinnɛma e ra naxan na.»<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />«Ayuba, i xa i tuli mati n ma masenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">I xa Ala xa kaabanakoe mato.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />I na birin naba ki kolon Ala yi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">A seyamakɔnyi raminima nuxui kui ki naxɛ, i na kolon?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Nuxui luma koore ma ki naxɛ, i na fan kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Na birin findixi Ala xa lɔnni xungbe nan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">naxan maniyɛ mu na.<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Foye fure nɛfɛ mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">kuye ifurama i tan naxan ma,<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />i fan nɔma koore walaxɛ nde yailande alɔ Ala?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Muxu naxan masenma Ala bɛ na fala muxu bɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">Na lɔnni mɔɔli mu muxu yi.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />N na wɔyɛn, fo mixi gbɛtɛ xa na radangi nɛ a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Fo fe nde xa fala a bɛ a fa kolon sɔtɔ na ma?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Yakɔsi soge mu toma nuxuie xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">fo foye e ba a ya ma.»<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />«Yanbɛ tofanyi nde na kelife kɔɔla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">naxan findixi Ala xa nɔrɛ xungbe ra.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Adama mu nɔma Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi lide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">A sɛnbɛ gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">a tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">A mu nɔma tinxintɔɛ tɔɔrɔde.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Adama lan a xa gaaxu Ala ya ra na nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">Yɛtɛ igboe mu rafan a ma.»<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa masenyi singe Ayuba bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ayuba, n yaabi xa i nɔma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Ala naxa Ayuba yaabi turunnaadɛ foye kui, a naxɛ,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />«Nde na n ma walie ya isofe a xa xaxilitare wɔyɛnyie ra?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />I i tagi ixiri gben alɔ gbangbalanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">n xa maxɔrinyi ndee ti i ma, i xa n yaabi.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />I nu na minden n to nu duniɲa daama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Na fala ba xa lɔnni kanyi na i ra.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />I a kolon nde duniɲa maniyaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Nde a maniyɛ luutie italaxi?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Duniɲa bunyi na minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">Nde gɛmɛ tixi duniɲa na naxan fari?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Nde na raba tunbuie to nu e sɛɛwɛ xui itema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">malekɛ bɛɛtibae fan to nu n xili matɔxɔma?»<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />«Nde baa naadɛe balan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">n to a ramini bɔxi ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />N tan nan nuxui ragoro a ma, n dimi dusu a xun na,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />n a naaninyi sa alako a naxa dangi mɛnni ra.<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />N tan nan dande sa mɔrɔnyie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">alako e naxa te, e a radangi a i.»<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />«I bara yaamari fi lɔxɔɛ keren i xa simaya kui subaxɛ xa mini,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />a xa mixi ɲaaxie ratɛrɛnna, a e makɛnɛn?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Duniɲa birin makɛnɛnma nɛ subaxɛ naiyalanyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">a lu alɔ bɛndɛ bunda tɔnxuma saxi naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">A yire birin toma nɛ alɔ dugi maɲingixi.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxie tan bara kuma naiyalanyi ra, e sɛnbɛ bara kana.»<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />«I baa ye kelide kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">I bara baa bunyi li?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />I bara aligiyama sode dɛ to?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">I bara saya naadɛ igbɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />I duniɲa igboɲa kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">A fala n bɛ xa i na fe birin kolon.»<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />«Naiyalanyi kelima minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">Dimi xɔnyi na minden?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />I na yiree kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">I naa siga kira kolon?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Xa i na birin kolon, awa i ɲan nu bara bari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">i xa simaya gbo.<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />I balabalanyi ragatade kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">I bara na yire to?<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />N na balabalanyi ragataxi tɔɔrɛ tɛmui nan ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">gere ti lɔxɔɛ ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Seyamakɔnyi kelima minden a yensen yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">Foye naxan kelima sogetede, na a ɲɛrɛma duniɲa ma di?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Nde tunɛ kira rabɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">a seyamakɔnyi nun galanyi yamari e xa mini?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Nde a niyaxi tunɛ xa bira bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">mixi mu na dɛnnaxɛ alɔ gbengberen yire?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Nde a niyaxi ɲooge xa bula wula i?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Nde findixi tunɛ baba ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Nde xini raminima?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Nde balabalanyi daaxi naxan kelima koore ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Nde a niyama baa ye xa xinbeli a xɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">a findi balabalanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">a dusu baa xun na a xɔrɔxɔ alɔ gɛmɛe?»<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />«I tan nan tunbuie sa koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">kankan xa lu a yire a tofan ki ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />I tan nan tunbuie raminixi e waxati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">alako adamadie xa nɔ sube tɔnxumae tode e ya ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />I koore yamari ki kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">I bara so bɔxi yailan ki kui?»<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />«I fata nuxuie yamaride alako ye xa banbaran yɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />I fata seyamakɔnyi yamaride alako e xa i xa wali raba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">E luma i xa yaamari bun ma, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">‹Muxu na be?›<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Nde lɔnni rasoxi adamadi bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">a a xaxili daa?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Xaxilima mundun nɔma nuxui birin kɔntide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">Nde nɔma ye ragorode keli koore ma,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />alako bɔxi xa bunda, xube xa findi boora ra?»<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />«Yɛtɛe nɛ saxi kaamɛ ra e ma,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />i tan nan sube fima e ma e xa kaamɛ ba?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Xaxae go, e xa die nɛ wama koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">i tan nan e baloma?»<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa masenyi firin nde Ayuba bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Nde mɛɛnima subee ma?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />«I wula i si di bari tɛmui kolon geyae fari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">I bara xeli to di bari ra?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />I e xa furi maxanin kike kɔnti kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">beenu e di bari waxati xa a li?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />E na e sa, e di barima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">alako e xa fulun e furi xa xɔnɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />E xa die na mɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">e keli e nga xun ma, e mu fa sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />«Nde luuti baxi sofale ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">a a rabɛɲin wula i?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />N tan nan wula findixi a xɔnyi ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">n a lu yire, fɔxɛ sunbuxi bɛndɛ ra dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Taa xa wundui mu rafan a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">a mu tinma mixie xa a raɲɛrɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />A wula isama ɲooge fende a balose ra.»<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />«I nɔma sɛxɛ ninge rawalide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">A kɔɛ radangima i xa gɔɔrɛ kui?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />I nɔma a xiride sari ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">a xa bɔxi buxa i bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />I i yigi suxuma a sɛnbɛ gbe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">I nɔma i xa wali xungbee taxude a ra?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />I nɔma a xɛɛde xɛ xabɛ, a xa i mali i xa baloe rasode?»<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />«Xɔni mɔɔli nde na na naxan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">gabutenyi dunkee ibɔnbɔma sɛɛwɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">kɔnɔ e mu tofan gbongboe gabutenyie bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />A a xɛlɛe sama bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">a e lu mɛyɛnyi bun ma alako wuyenyi xa lu e ma,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />a mu a maɲɔxun sube nde nɔma tide e fari, e bula.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />A mu mɛɛnima a xa die ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">a luma alɔ a gbe mu e ra.<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />A na mɔɔli rabama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">barima Ala mu lɔnni nun xaxili fanyi fixi a ma.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Kɔnɔ a na a gi fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">a soe ragie nun soe luma nɛ a xanbi ra.»<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />«I tan nan soe sɛnbɛ fima a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">I tan nan a kɔnyi xabee rakuyama?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />I tan nan a niyama a xa nɔ tugande alɔ katoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">a birin magaaxu a xui ra?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />A bɔxi iboronma a sanyi ra, a ɲɛlɛxinxi a sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />A mu gaaxuma sese ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">a mu a magbilenma santidɛgɛma ya i.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Tanbɛe nun e sase gbakuxi a ma,<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />a gbataxi tuganma, a xulun a gide gere yire.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Gere sara na fe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">a tan kelima nɛ fa keren na a gereso ki ma.»<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />«I xa lɔnni bara a niya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">sɛgɛ xa a ɲɛrɛ koore ma sigafe ra yirefanyi ma?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />I tan nan yaamari fima a ma a xa a tɛɛ sa yire itexi?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Kɔɛ ra, a yigiyama gɛmɛ longori ra geyae fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">Mɛnni nan findixi a bɛ a makantade nan na.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />A subee toma na yire makuye nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">a baloma naxee ra.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Sube xinde ɲɔxun a xa diyɔrɛe bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">Binbi lu dɛdɛ a na mɛnni.»<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa masenyi saxan nde Ayuba bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Nde mu lama Ala ra?»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Alatala man naxa a masen Ayuba bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />«I tan naxan Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanyi kalamuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">i suusama a rakiitide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Xa lɔnnila na i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">yaabi nde ti yi birin ma ba.»<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Ayuba naxa Alatala yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />«Mixi xuri di nan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">N tan i yaabima munse ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">N bara n dɛ suxu n bɛlɛxɛ ra, n dundu yen.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />N wɔyɛn nɛ keren, n naxa wɔyɛn firin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">Na xanbi, n mu sese sama na fari sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Ala man naxa a masen Ayuba bɛ turunnaadɛ foye kui,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />«I i tagi xiri gben alɔ gbangbalanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">n xa maxɔrinyi ndee ti i ma, i xa n yaabi.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />I mu laxi a ra n ma kiiti tinxin?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">I wama nɔndi bafe n yi ra nɛ, a xa lu i tan bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />I sɛnbɛ gbo Ala gbe bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">I xui magaaxu alɔ a gbe?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Na kui, i i maxiri nɔrɛ nun xunnakeli ra ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">i xa tofan, i xa i sɛnbɛ masen.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />I xa i xa xɔnɛ magaaxuxi ramini ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">i yɛtɛ igboee xun nakana.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />E birin kuntan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">mixi ɲaaxie igbantu e yire.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Bɛndɛ radin e birin xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">e balan gaburi kui.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Na tɛmui n fan yɛtɛ yati i matɔxɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">barima i yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ bara i rakisi.»<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />«Mali mato ba a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">na sube magaaxuxi n naxan daaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">alɔ n i fan daaxi ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">A ɲooge donma alɔ ninge.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />A sɛnbɛ gbe na a gungui nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">sɛnbɛ malanxi a furi kiri bun.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />A xuli sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ konde bili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">a sanyi fasɛe wuya, e gadara.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />A xɔrie luxi alɔ yɔxui, xa na mu a ra wure.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Ala xa daalise fisamante nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">kɔnɔ a gaaxuma Ala xa santidɛgɛma ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />A a baloe fenma geyae kɔn sube xaaɲɛe ya ma.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />A xima niini bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">a a nɔxun dabonyie kui.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />A a malabuma wuri bilie niini bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">naxee na dabon dɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Dabonyi ye xa gboe mu a magaaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">Yurudɛn xure na banbaran yɛ, a mu a tɔɔrɔma.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />A ya rabixi nɔma suxude?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">A nɔma suxude gantanyi ra, a ɲɔɛ xa tunba?»<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 40:25" />«I nɔma sɔɲɛ suxude kɔnyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:25">I nɔma a dɛ xiride, i a ba ye xɔɔra?<verse eid="JOB 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 40:26" />I nɔma a ɲɔɛ, xa na mu a ra a dɛ tunbade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:26">i luuti sa a ma?<verse eid="JOB 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 40:27" />A i mayandima i xa a fulun?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:27">A hayi na wɔyɛnyi ɲɔxunmɛ ma a falafe ra i bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 40:28" />Wo saatɛ xirima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:28">A findima i xa konyi ra a xa simaya kui?<verse eid="JOB 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 40:29" />I nɔma berede a ra alɔ xɔni di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:29">I nɔma a xiride, a findi i xa die xa bere se ra?<verse eid="JOB 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 40:30" />I nɔma a matide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:30">Yulɛe a itaxunma e bore ma?<verse eid="JOB 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 40:31" />I nɔma a kiri masɔxɔde tanbɛe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:31">I nɔma a xunyi sɔxɔde sɔxɔse nde ra?<verse eid="JOB 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 40:32" />Gere ti a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:32">na mu nɛɛmuma i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:32">I mu na ifirinma sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="JOB 40:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="s1">Ala xa masenyi naani nde Ayuba bɛ</para>
  <para style="s2">«Ala xa daalise sɛnbɛma»</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />«Mixi mu nɔma a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">a xa toe gbansan findima gaaxui nan na.<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Xa mixi mu suusama a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">nde fa nɔma suusade n tan ya ra?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Nde n donixi se nde ra n naxan nagbilenma a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Duniɲa birin findixi n gbe nan na.<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />N mu nɔma dundude na sɔɲɛ xa fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">a salonsee sɛnbɛ gbo, a man tofan.<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />A bura fɛɛrɛ na nde bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">Nde mu gaaxuma a ɲinyie ya ra?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Nde nɔma a dɛ rabide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">A ɲinyi magaaxuxie a dɛ kui rafexi.<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Xalee fatuxi a kiri ma alɔ sɔɔri xa wure lefa,<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />e xɛtɛnxi e bore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">foye sode yati mu na e tagi<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />e fatuxi e bore ma a fanyi ra.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />A na ɲɛngi sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">yanbɛ nan luma mini ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">a yae fan luxi alɔ gɛɛsɛgɛ soge.<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Tɛ yiriyiri minima a dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">e fulefulee nu fa yensen yɛ kuye ma.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Tuuri nde minima a ɲɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">na luxi nɛ alɔ fifa naxan dɔxɔxi tɛ ma, a satunfe.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />A ɲɛngi findima tɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">tɛ yiriyiri nu fa mini a dɛ i.<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Sɛnbɛ xutunxi a kɔnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">birin gaaxuma a ya ra.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />A kiri xɔrɔxɔ, a sɛnbɛ gbo.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />A kanke luxi alɔ gɛmɛ xungbe.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />A na ti, limaniya bama nɛ sɛnbɛmae yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">e sɛrɛn, e e gi.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Santidɛgɛma na din a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">a mu a xabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">Tanbɛ mɔɔli yo mu na naxan nɔma a sɔxɔde.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Wure luxi nɛ a bɛ alɔ sɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">yɔxui lu a bɛ alɔ wuri bɔrɔxi.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />A mu gaaxuma tanbɛe ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">laati kuni luma a bɛ alɔ maale lagi.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Gbendegela luma a bɛ alɔ sɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">tanbɛ xungbe mayele a bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Bɛlɛ xɛɲɛnxi nde nun tunbee na a furi bunyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">nee luma boora tirindin na nɛ alɔ sari to yire buxama.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />A baa ixufuxufuma alɔ ye nɛ satunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">a dabonyi lu alɔ ture nɛ satunma.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />A na a ɲɛrɛ ye xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">mɔrɔnyi fiixɛ nan luma te ra a xanbi ra.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Mangɛ yo mu a bɛ duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">a daaxi nɛ, gaaxui yo mu a yi.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />A a ya ragoroma nɛ daalise yɛtɛ igboe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">a findixi subee birin ma mangɛ nan na.»<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s1">Ayuba xa yaabi firin nde nun Ala xa masenyi dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Ayuba naxa Alatala yaabi,<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />«N bara a kolon i nɔma fe birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">sese mu nɔma i ɲanige kanade.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />I a masen nɛ i xa masenyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">‹Nde na n ma walie ya isofe a xa xaxilitare wɔyɛnyie ra?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">I nɔndi, n bara wɔyɛn a xaxilitare daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">n mu nu i xa kaabanakoe fahaamuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">I xa fe rabaxie gbo n xunyi bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />I man a masen nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">‹I tuli mati n na, n xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">N xa maxɔrinyi ndee ti i ma, i xa n yaabi.›<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />A singe n nu i xa fe ifalɛ nan mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">kɔnɔ yakɔsi, n bara so na fe kui.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />N a kolonxi na nan ma n naxan nabaxi a mu fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">N bara tuubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">n bara n magoro bɛndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">n tɛ xube maso n ma sunnunyi kui.»<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Alatala to gɛ a xa masenyi tide Ayuba bɛ, a naxa a masen Elifasi Temanka bɛ, «N bara xɔnɔ i tan nun i boore firinyie ma, barima wo mu nɔndi falaxi n ma fe ra, alɔ n ma konyi Ayuba a rabaxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Na kui wo ninge nun yɛxɛɛ kontonyi solofere ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra wo yɛtɛ bɛ. Wo sa Ayuba fen, a xa duba wo bɛ. Wo mu nɔndi falaxi n ma fe ra alɔ Ayuba a rabaxi ki naxɛ, kɔnɔ n mu wo ɲaxankatama wo xa daxuɲa ma Ayuba xa fe ra.»<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Elifasi Temanka, Bilidada Suuxaka, nun Sofara Naamaka naxa fe birin naba alɔ Alatala a yamari e ra ki naxɛ. Alatala naxa Ayuba xa dubɛ suxu. <verse eid="JOB 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Ayuba to gɛ dubade a booree bɛ, Alatala naxa a harige birin nagbilen a ma. A man naxa na harige xun masa dɔxɔ firin dangife a singe ra.<verse eid="JOB 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Ayuba xunyae nun a taarae nun a kolonma birin naxa fa a xɛɛbude a xɔnyi, e e dɛge yire keren. E naxa a nu tɔɔrɔ sa, e a kunfa ba tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra Alatala nu bara naxan dɔxɔ a ma. Kankan naxa kɔbiri kole keren nun xurundɛ xɛɛma daaxi keren fi a ma.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Alatala naxa barakɛ sa Ayuba dangife a singe ra. A naxa yɛxɛɛ wulu fu nun naani sɔtɔ, ɲɔxɔmɛ wulu senni, ninge wulu keren, nun sofale wulu keren. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />A naxa di xɛmɛ solofere nun di ginɛ saxan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />A xa di ginɛ singe nu xili nɛ Yemima, a firin nde Kesiya, a saxan nde Kerenapuku. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Ginɛ yo mu nu na na bɔxi ma naxan nu tofan Ayuba xa die bɛ. E baba naxa kɛ fi e fan ma, alɔ a rabaxi ki naxɛ e maaxɛmɛe bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Na dangi xanbi, ɲɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛ tongo naani naxa sa Ayuba xa simaya xun ma. A naxa a xa die to, a xa mamadie, a tolobitɛe, nun a tolontolonyie. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Ayuba xa simaya kamalixi nɛ a fanyi ra, a fa laaxira.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>